DATA.push({"c":"toeic","l":2,"w":[["signage","/ˈsaɪnɪdʒ/","n.","標示、招牌（總稱）","Clear signage helps shoppers find what they need.","清楚的標示幫助購物者找到所需商品。"],["response rate","/rɪˈspɑːns reɪt/","phr.","回覆率、回應率","The survey had a response rate of 40 percent.","這份調查的回覆率為百分之四十。"],["feedback form","/ˈfiːdbæk fɔːrm/","phr.","意見表","Please leave your comments on the feedback form.","請在意見表上留下您的意見。"],["comment card","/ˈkɑːment kɑːrd/","phr.","意見卡","Comment cards are available at the front desk.","意見卡放在櫃台。"],["manufacturing","/ˌmænjəˈfæktʃərɪŋ/","n.","製造業；製造","Manufacturing makes up a large part of the economy.","製造業占經濟的很大一部分。"],["assembly","/əˈsembli/","n.","組裝","Assembly of the product takes about two hours.","這項產品的組裝大約需要兩小時。"],["machinery","/məˈʃiːnəri/","n.","機器（總稱）、機械","The factory bought new machinery last year.","工廠去年購入了新機械。"],["raw material","/ˌrɔː məˈtɪriəl/","n.","原料","The price of raw materials keeps rising.","原料價格持續上漲。"],["loading dock","/ˈloʊdɪŋ dɑːk/","n.","裝卸貨平台","Trucks must wait at the loading dock.","卡車必須在裝卸貨平台等候。"],["vessel","/ˈvesəl/","n.","船隻；容器","The vessel will dock in Kaohsiung tomorrow.","這艘船明天將停靠高雄港。"],["tracking number","/ˈtrækɪŋ ˌnʌmbər/","n.","追蹤號碼、貨運單號","Use the tracking number to check your package.","用追蹤號碼查詢您的包裹。"],["depart","/dɪˈpɑːrt/","v.","出發、離開","The ship departs from Keelung at 8 a.m.","船於早上八點從基隆出發。"],["transportation","/ˌtrænspərˈteɪʃən/","n.","運輸、交通","Transportation costs have risen sharply.","運輸成本大幅上升。"],["carrier","/ˈkæriər/","n.","貨運業者、運送公司","We switched to a cheaper carrier.","我們改用較便宜的貨運業者。"],["reorder","/riˈɔːrdər/","v.","再訂購、補貨","It's time to reorder printer paper.","該補訂印表機用紙了。"],["excess","/ˈekses/","adj./n.","過剩的；過量","We sold the excess stock at a discount.","我們把過剩庫存打折賣掉了。"],["standard","/ˈstændərd/","n.","標準","All products must meet safety standards.","所有產品都必須符合安全標準。"],["quality control","/ˈkwɑːləti kənˌtroʊl/","n.","品質管制、品管","Quality control checks every tenth item.","品管每十件抽檢一件。"],["inspector","/ɪnˈspektər/","n.","檢查員、檢驗員","A safety inspector visited the plant.","一位安全檢查員來到工廠視察。"],["measurement","/ˈmeʒərmənt/","n.","測量；尺寸","Please send us the exact measurements.","請將確切的尺寸寄給我們。"],["installation","/ˌɪnstəˈleɪʃən/","n.","安裝","Installation of the new system takes a week.","新系統的安裝需要一週。"],["automated","/ˈɔːtəmeɪtɪd/","adj.","自動化的","Most of the process is now automated.","大部分的流程現在都已自動化。"],["labor cost","/ˈleɪbər kɔːst/","n.","人工成本","Automation helped us cut labor costs.","自動化幫助我們降低了人工成本。"],["purchasing","/ˈpɜːrtʃəsɪŋ/","n.","採購","She works in the purchasing department.","她在採購部門工作。"],["supply chain","/səˈplaɪ tʃeɪn/","n.","供應鏈","The storm disrupted the supply chain.","暴風雨打亂了供應鏈。"],["minimum order","/ˈmɪnɪməm ˈɔːrdər/","n.","最低訂購量","The minimum order is 500 units.","最低訂購量是五百件。"],["rush order","/ˈrʌʃ ˌɔːrdər/","n.","急件訂單","We can handle a rush order for an extra fee.","加收費用的話我們可以處理急單。"],["handling","/ˈhændlɪŋ/","n.","處理；搬運","Careful handling prevents damage.","小心搬運可以避免損壞。"],["shipping","/ˈʃɪpɪŋ/","n.","運送、出貨；運費","Shipping is free for orders over $50.","訂單超過五十美元免運費。"],["shipping cost","/ˈʃɪpɪŋ kɔːst/","n.","運費","The shipping cost is included in the price.","運費已含在售價中。"],["shipping and handling","/ˌʃɪpɪŋ ən ˈhændlɪŋ/","phr.","運費及處理費","Shipping and handling will be added at checkout.","結帳時會加上運費及處理費。"],["postage","/ˈpoʊstɪdʒ/","n.","郵資","How much is the postage for this parcel?","這個包裹的郵資是多少？"],["importer","/ɪmˈpɔːrtər/","n.","進口商","The importer handles all customs paperwork.","進口商負責所有的報關文件。"],["exporter","/ɪkˈspɔːrtər/","n.","出口商","Taiwan is a major exporter of chips.","台灣是晶片的主要出口國。"],["declare","/dɪˈkler/","v.","申報（海關）；宣布","You must declare all goods at customs.","所有貨品都必須向海關申報。"],["safety regulations","/ˈseɪfti ˌreɡjəˈleɪʃənz/","n.","安全規定","All visitors must follow safety regulations.","所有訪客都必須遵守安全規定。"],["protective gear","/prəˈtektɪv ɡɪr/","n.","防護裝備","Wear protective gear in the paint room.","在噴漆室要穿戴防護裝備。"],["goggles","/ˈɡɑːɡəlz/","n.","護目鏡","Put on your goggles before using the saw.","使用鋸子前戴上護目鏡。"],["break down","/ˌbreɪk ˈdaʊn/","phr.","故障、拋錨","The truck broke down on the highway.","卡車在高速公路上拋錨了。"],["shut down","/ˌʃʌt ˈdaʊn/","phr.","關閉；停工","The plant will shut down for repairs.","工廠將停工進行維修。"],["start up","/ˌstɑːrt ˈʌp/","phr.","啟動","It takes ten minutes to start up the line.","啟動生產線需要十分鐘。"],["idle","/ˈaɪdl/","adj.","閒置的、停工的","The machines were idle during the holiday.","假期期間機器都閒置著。"],["power outage","/ˈpaʊər ˌaʊtɪdʒ/","n.","停電","A power outage stopped the assembly line.","停電使組裝線停擺。"],["generator","/ˈdʒenəreɪtər/","n.","發電機","The backup generator turned on automatically.","備用發電機自動啟動了。"],["chemical","/ˈkemɪkəl/","n.","化學品","Store chemicals in a locked room.","化學品要存放在上鎖的房間。"],["electronics","/ɪˌlekˈtrɑːnɪks/","n.","電子產品；電子學","The company makes consumer electronics.","這家公司生產消費性電子產品。"],["hardware","/ˈhɑːrdwer/","n.","五金；硬體","You can buy screws at the hardware store.","你可以在五金行買到螺絲。"],["modify","/ˈmɑːdɪfaɪ/","v.","修改、改造","We modified the design to cut costs.","我們修改了設計以降低成本。"],["adjustment","/əˈdʒʌstmənt/","n.","調整","The machine needs a small adjustment.","這台機器需要稍微調整一下。"],["durability","/ˌdʊrəˈbɪləti/","n.","耐用性","We test each product for durability.","我們會測試每件產品的耐用性。"],["sturdy","/ˈstɜːrdi/","adj.","堅固的、結實的","These shelves are sturdy enough for heavy boxes.","這些架子很堅固，足以放重箱子。"],["lightweight","/ˈlaɪtweɪt/","adj.","輕量的","The new model is smaller and lightweight.","新型號更小也更輕。"],["portable","/ˈpɔːrtəbəl/","adj.","可攜式的","We sell portable generators.","我們販售可攜式發電機。"],["heavy-duty","/ˌhevi ˈduːti/","adj.","耐用的、重型的","Use heavy-duty boxes for metal parts.","金屬零件請用加強型紙箱。"],["conveyor belt","/kənˈveɪər belt/","n.","輸送帶","Products move along a conveyor belt.","產品沿著輸送帶移動。"],["sensor","/ˈsensər/","n.","感應器、感測器","A sensor stops the machine if it overheats.","機器過熱時感測器會讓它停止。"],["valve","/vælv/","n.","閥門","Close the valve before you start the repair.","開始修理前先關閉閥門。"],["pump","/pʌmp/","n./v.","幫浦；抽送","The water pump needs to be replaced.","抽水幫浦需要更換。"],["trolley","/ˈtrɑːli/","n.","手推車","Load the boxes onto the trolley.","把箱子放上手推車。"],["shelving","/ˈʃelvɪŋ/","n.","架子（總稱）、層架","We installed new shelving in the stockroom.","我們在庫房裝了新的層架。"],["bin","/bɪn/","n.","箱子、儲物箱；垃圾桶","Small parts are kept in plastic bins.","小零件放在塑膠盒裡。"],["barcode","/ˈbɑːrkoʊd/","n.","條碼","Scan the barcode on each box.","掃描每個箱子上的條碼。"],["serial number","/ˈsɪriəl ˌnʌmbər/","n.","序號","The serial number is on the back of the unit.","序號在機身背面。"],["model number","/ˈmɑːdl ˌnʌmbər/","n.","型號","Please give us the model number of your printer.","請提供您印表機的型號。"],["instructions","/ɪnˈstrʌkʃənz/","n.","說明、指示","Read the instructions before using the machine.","使用機器前請先閱讀說明。"],["plant manager","/ˈplænt ˌmænɪdʒər/","n.","廠長","The plant manager approved the new schedule.","廠長核准了新的排程。"],["foreman","/ˈfɔːrmən/","n.","工頭、領班","Ask the foreman about your shift.","你的班表請問領班。"],["fall behind","/ˌfɔːl bɪˈhaɪnd/","phr.","落後","We fell behind schedule because of the strike.","因為罷工，我們進度落後了。"],["run short of","/ˌrʌn ˈʃɔːrt əv/","phr.","短缺、快用完","We are running short of boxes.","我們的箱子快不夠了。"],["in short supply","/ɪn ˌʃɔːrt səˈplaɪ/","phr.","供應短缺","Computer chips are in short supply.","電腦晶片供應短缺。"],["ship out","/ˌʃɪp ˈaʊt/","phr.","出貨、運出","The order will ship out tomorrow.","這筆訂單明天會出貨。"],["layout","/ˈleɪaʊt/","n.","配置、布局","We changed the layout of the warehouse.","我們改變了倉庫的配置。"],["take apart","/ˌteɪk əˈpɑːrt/","phr.","拆開、拆卸","The technician took apart the printer.","技師把印表機拆開了。"],["fill an order","/ˌfɪl ən ˈɔːrdər/","phr.","完成訂單出貨","We can fill your order within three days.","我們可以在三天內完成您的訂單。"],["process an order","/ˌprɑːses ən ˈɔːrdər/","phr.","處理訂單","It takes one day to process an order.","處理一筆訂單需要一天。"],["cancel an order","/ˌkænsəl ən ˈɔːrdər/","phr.","取消訂單","You can cancel an order before it ships.","商品出貨前您都可以取消訂單。"],["track a package","/ˌtræk ə ˈpækɪdʒ/","phr.","追蹤包裹","You can track a package on our website.","您可以在我們的網站上追蹤包裹。"],["air freight","/ˈer freɪt/","n.","空運貨物；空運","Air freight is faster but more expensive.","空運比較快，但比較貴。"],["sea freight","/ˈsiː freɪt/","n.","海運","Most heavy goods go by sea freight.","大多數重型貨物走海運。"],["overnight delivery","/ˌoʊvərnaɪt dɪˈlɪvəri/","n.","隔夜送達","We offer overnight delivery for urgent orders.","急件我們提供隔夜送達服務。"],["express delivery","/ɪkˈspres dɪˈlɪvəri/","n.","快遞","Express delivery costs an extra $20.","快遞要多收二十美元。"],["same-day delivery","/ˌseɪm deɪ dɪˈlɪvəri/","n.","當日送達","Same-day delivery is available in the city.","市區提供當日送達服務。"],["sign for","/ˈsaɪn fɔːr/","phr.","簽收","Someone must sign for the package.","必須有人簽收這個包裹。"],["rejection","/rɪˈdʒekʃən/","n.","拒收；退件","The rejection rate fell after the training.","訓練後退件率下降了。"],["warehousing","/ˈwerhaʊzɪŋ/","n.","倉儲","Warehousing costs are rising in the city.","市區的倉儲成本在上升。"],["storage space","/ˈstɔːrɪdʒ speɪs/","n.","儲存空間","We need more storage space for the new stock.","我們需要更多空間存放新庫存。"],["inventory level","/ˈɪnvəntɔːri ˌlevəl/","n.","庫存量","We check inventory levels every week.","我們每週檢查庫存量。"],["fleet","/fliːt/","n.","車隊；船隊","The company has a fleet of fifty trucks.","公司擁有五十輛卡車的車隊。"],["container ship","/kənˈteɪnər ʃɪp/","n.","貨櫃船","The container ship arrived two days late.","貨櫃船晚了兩天抵達。"],["haul","/hɔːl/","v./n.","運送、拖運","The truck hauls goods across the country.","這輛卡車在全國各地運貨。"],["transit","/ˈtrænzɪt/","n.","運輸；運送途中","The goods were damaged in transit.","貨物在運送途中損壞。"],["origin","/ˈɔːrɪdʒɪn/","n.","起源；產地","Please state the origin of the goods.","請註明貨物的產地。"],["shipper","/ˈʃɪpər/","n.","託運人；貨運公司","The shipper is responsible for the packaging.","託運人負責包裝。"],["shipping label","/ˈʃɪpɪŋ ˌleɪbəl/","n.","貨運標籤、出貨標籤","Print the shipping label and attach it to the box.","列印出貨標籤並貼在箱子上。"],["packing list","/ˈpækɪŋ lɪst/","n.","裝箱單","Check the items against the packing list.","依照裝箱單核對品項。"],["packing slip","/ˈpækɪŋ slɪp/","n.","出貨單、裝箱單","A packing slip is included in every box.","每箱都附有出貨單。"],["packing material","/ˈpækɪŋ məˌtɪriəl/","n.","包裝材料","Use enough packing material to protect the item.","使用足夠的包材保護物品。"],["bubble wrap","/ˈbʌbəl ræp/","n.","氣泡紙","Wrap the vase in bubble wrap.","用氣泡紙把花瓶包起來。"],["sealed","/siːld/","adj.","密封的","Keep the samples in a sealed bag.","把樣品放在密封袋裡。"],["fasten","/ˈfæsən/","v.","固定、繫緊","Fasten the load securely to the truck.","把貨物牢牢固定在卡車上。"],["intact","/ɪnˈtækt/","adj.","完好無缺的","All items arrived intact.","所有物品都完好送達。"],["misplace","/ˌmɪsˈpleɪs/","v.","放錯地方、找不到","I misplaced the invoice for the shipment.","我把這批貨的發票放錯地方了。"],["mismatch","/ˈmɪsmætʃ/","n.","不符、不一致","There's a mismatch between the order and the invoice.","訂單和發票內容不符。"],["file a claim","/ˌfaɪl ə ˈkleɪm/","phr.","提出索賠","You can file a claim for damaged goods.","貨物損壞可以提出索賠。"],["insure","/ɪnˈʃʊr/","v.","為……投保","We insure every shipment against loss.","我們為每批貨投保遺失險。"],["substandard","/ˌsʌbˈstændərd/","adj.","不合標準的","We returned the substandard materials.","我們退回了不合標準的材料。"],["inferior","/ɪnˈfɪriər/","adj.","較差的、次等的","The new supplier's parts are inferior.","新供應商的零件品質較差。"],["up to standard","/ˌʌp tə ˈstændərd/","phr.","達到標準","The samples were not up to standard.","樣品沒有達到標準。"],["mass production","/ˌmæs prəˈdʌkʃən/","n.","大量生產、量產","Mass production will begin next month.","下個月將開始量產。"],["large-scale","/ˌlɑːrdʒ ˈskeɪl/","adj.","大規模的","They run a large-scale factory in Vietnam.","他們在越南經營一座大規模工廠。"],["customized","/ˈkʌstəmaɪzd/","adj.","客製化的","They ordered customized packaging.","他們訂購了客製化包裝。"],["in-house","/ˌɪn ˈhaʊs/","adv.","在公司內部、自家","All parts are made in-house.","所有零件都是自家生產的。"],["depot","/ˈdiːpoʊ/","n.","倉庫、貨棧；車站","The trucks return to the depot at night.","卡車晚上會回到車庫。"],["distribution center","/ˌdɪstrɪˈbjuːʃən ˌsentər/","n.","物流中心、配送中心","The new distribution center opens next year.","新的物流中心明年啟用。"],["fulfillment","/fʊlˈfɪlmənt/","n.","訂單履行、出貨處理","Order fulfillment is handled by a partner.","訂單出貨由合作夥伴處理。"],["partner","/ˈpɑːrtnər/","n.","合作夥伴","Our logistics partner delivers across Asia.","我們的物流夥伴配送範圍遍及亞洲。"],["disruption","/dɪsˈrʌpʃən/","n.","中斷、擾亂","The strike caused a disruption in deliveries.","罷工造成交貨中斷。"],["disrupt","/dɪsˈrʌpt/","v.","擾亂、使中斷","Bad weather disrupted shipping routes.","惡劣天氣打亂了航運路線。"],["interrupt","/ˌɪntəˈrʌpt/","v.","中斷、打斷","The power cut interrupted production.","停電中斷了生產。"],["halt","/hɔːlt/","v./n.","停止、暫停","The factory halted production for a week.","工廠停產了一週。"],["suspend","/səˈspend/","v.","暫停、中止","Shipments were suspended due to the typhoon.","因颱風，出貨暫停。"],["production schedule","/prəˈdʌkʃən ˌskedʒuːl/","n.","生產排程","The production schedule is very tight this month.","這個月的生產排程很緊。"],["production capacity","/prəˈdʌkʃən kəˌpæsəti/","n.","產能","We plan to double our production capacity.","我們計畫將產能加倍。"],["factory floor","/ˈfæktəri flɔːr/","n.","廠房作業區、生產現場","Visitors are not allowed on the factory floor.","訪客不得進入生產現場。"],["plant tour","/ˈplænt tʊr/","n.","工廠參觀","We arranged a plant tour for the clients.","我們為客戶安排了工廠參觀。"],["work order","/ˈwɜːrk ˌɔːrdər/","n.","工單","The technician received a new work order.","技師收到一張新工單。"],["lot number","/ˈlɑːt ˌnʌmbər/","n.","批號","Write the lot number on the report.","在報告上寫下批號。"],["stockroom","/ˈstɑːkruːm/","n.","庫房、儲藏室","Extra supplies are in the stockroom.","多餘的用品放在庫房。"],["storeroom","/ˈstɔːrruːm/","n.","儲藏室","The storeroom is locked after 6 p.m.","儲藏室晚上六點後會上鎖。"],["delivery fee","/dɪˈlɪvəri fiː/","n.","運費、外送費","There is no delivery fee for local orders.","本地訂單不收運費。"],["delivery service","/dɪˈlɪvəri ˌsɜːrvɪs/","n.","送貨服務、快遞服務","We use a reliable delivery service.","我們使用可靠的快遞服務。"],["delivery schedule","/dɪˈlɪvəri ˌskedʒuːl/","n.","交貨時程","The supplier sent us a new delivery schedule.","供應商寄給我們新的交貨時程表。"],["late delivery","/ˌleɪt dɪˈlɪvəri/","n.","延遲交貨","We apologize for the late delivery.","對於延遲交貨我們深感抱歉。"],["registered mail","/ˌredʒɪstərd ˈmeɪl/","n.","掛號信","Send the contract by registered mail.","用掛號寄出合約。"],["forwarding address","/ˈfɔːrwərdɪŋ əˌdres/","n.","轉寄地址","Please leave a forwarding address.","請留下轉寄地址。"],["return label","/rɪˈtɜːrn ˌleɪbəl/","n.","退貨標籤","A return label is included in the box.","箱內附有退貨標籤。"],["order status","/ˈɔːrdər ˌsteɪtəs/","n.","訂單狀態","You can check your order status online.","您可以上網查詢訂單狀態。"],["pending order","/ˌpendɪŋ ˈɔːrdər/","n.","待處理訂單","We have twenty pending orders.","我們有二十筆待處理訂單。"],["bulk order","/ˌbʌlk ˈɔːrdər/","n.","大宗訂單","We offer discounts on bulk orders.","大量訂購有折扣。"],["on order","/ˌɑːn ˈɔːrdər/","phr.","已訂購（尚未到貨）","The new forklift is on order.","新的堆高機已經下訂了。"],["discontinued","/ˌdɪskənˈtɪnjuːd/","adj.","停產的","That model has been discontinued.","那個型號已經停產了。"],["stock level","/ˈstɑːk ˌlevəl/","n.","庫存水準","Stock levels are low after the sale.","特賣過後庫存偏低。"],["take inventory","/ˌteɪk ˈɪnvəntɔːri/","phr.","盤點存貨","We take inventory at the end of each month.","我們每月底盤點存貨。"],["storage facility","/ˈstɔːrɪdʒ fəˌsɪləti/","n.","倉儲設施","The goods are kept in a storage facility.","貨物存放在倉儲設施。"],["refrigerated","/rɪˈfrɪdʒəreɪtɪd/","adj.","冷藏的","The food is shipped in refrigerated trucks.","食品用冷藏車運送。"],["perishable goods","/ˌperɪʃəbəl ˈɡʊdz/","n.","易腐壞物品","Perishable goods must be delivered quickly.","易腐壞物品必須迅速送達。"],["humidity","/hjuːˈmɪdəti/","n.","濕度","High humidity can damage the paper.","高濕度會損壞紙張。"],["moisture","/ˈmɔɪstʃər/","n.","濕氣、水分","Keep the boxes away from moisture.","箱子要遠離濕氣。"],["spoil","/spɔɪl/","v.","變質、腐壞","Fresh fruit can spoil during shipping.","新鮮水果在運送途中可能腐壞。"],["quality check","/ˈkwɑːləti tʃek/","n.","品質檢查","Every batch goes through a quality check.","每一批都會經過品質檢查。"],["spot check","/ˈspɑːt tʃek/","n.","抽查、抽檢","The manager did a spot check of the stock.","經理抽查了庫存。"],["test run","/ˈtest rʌn/","n.","試運轉","We'll do a test run before full production.","全面生產前我們會先試運轉。"],["trial run","/ˈtraɪəl rʌn/","n.","試行、試運轉","The new line passed the trial run.","新的生產線通過了試運轉。"],["inspection report","/ɪnˈspekʃən rɪˌpɔːrt/","n.","檢驗報告","Please attach the inspection report.","請附上檢驗報告。"],["safety inspection","/ˈseɪfti ɪnˌspekʃən/","n.","安全檢查","The plant passed its safety inspection.","工廠通過了安全檢查。"],["safety goggles","/ˈseɪfti ˌɡɑːɡəlz/","n.","安全護目鏡","Safety goggles are required in this area.","此區必須戴安全護目鏡。"],["safety vest","/ˈseɪfti vest/","n.","安全背心、反光背心","Wear a safety vest in the loading area.","在裝卸區請穿反光背心。"],["safety procedures","/ˈseɪfti prəˌsiːdʒərz/","n.","安全程序","New workers learn the safety procedures first.","新進員工要先學習安全程序。"],["evacuation","/ɪˌvækjuˈeɪʃən/","n.","撤離、疏散","The evacuation took only five minutes.","疏散只花了五分鐘。"],["toxic","/ˈtɑːksɪk/","adj.","有毒的","Toxic waste must be handled carefully.","有毒廢料必須小心處理。"],["flammable","/ˈflæməbəl/","adj.","易燃的","Keep flammable materials away from heat.","易燃物品須遠離熱源。"],["ventilation","/ˌventɪˈleɪʃən/","n.","通風","Good ventilation is needed in the paint room.","噴漆室需要良好的通風。"],["overheat","/ˌoʊvərˈhiːt/","v.","過熱","The motor overheated and shut down.","馬達過熱後停機了。"],["power supply","/ˈpaʊər səˌplaɪ/","n.","電源供應","Check the power supply before testing.","測試前先檢查電源。"],["unplug","/ʌnˈplʌɡ/","v.","拔掉插頭","Unplug the machine before cleaning it.","清潔機器前先拔掉插頭。"],["user manual","/ˈjuːzər ˌmænjuəl/","n.","使用手冊","See page ten of the user manual.","請參閱使用手冊第十頁。"],["assembly instructions","/əˈsembli ɪnˌstrʌkʃənz/","n.","組裝說明","The assembly instructions are easy to follow.","組裝說明很容易照著做。"],["repair shop","/rɪˈper ʃɑːp/","n.","修理廠、維修店","The van is still at the repair shop.","貨車還在修理廠。"],["routine maintenance","/ruːˌtiːn ˈmeɪntənəns/","n.","例行維護","Routine maintenance is done every Friday.","每週五進行例行維護。"],["under repair","/ˌʌndər rɪˈper/","phr.","維修中","The forklift is under repair.","堆高機正在維修中。"],["in working order","/ɪn ˌwɜːrkɪŋ ˈɔːrdər/","phr.","運作正常","Make sure the scanner is in working order.","確認掃描器運作正常。"],["service call","/ˈsɜːrvɪs kɔːl/","n.","到府維修服務","The technician has three service calls today.","技師今天有三個維修案件。"],["heavy machinery","/ˌhevi məˈʃiːnəri/","n.","重型機械","Only licensed workers may operate heavy machinery.","只有持證工人可以操作重型機械。"],["industrial","/ɪnˈdʌstriəl/","adj.","工業的","The factory is in an industrial park.","工廠位於工業區內。"],["industry","/ˈɪndəstri/","n.","產業、工業","The textile industry employs many people.","紡織業雇用了很多人。"],["product recall","/ˈprɑːdʌkt ˌriːkɔːl/","n.","產品召回","The product recall cost the company millions.","產品召回讓公司損失數百萬。"],["diagram","/ˈdaɪəɡræm/","n.","圖表、示意圖","Follow the diagram to connect the cables.","依照示意圖連接纜線。"],["accessory","/əkˈsesəri/","n.","配件","The camera comes with several accessories.","相機附有幾個配件。"],["wrench","/rentʃ/","n.","扳手","Hand me the wrench, please.","請把扳手遞給我。"],["screwdriver","/ˈskruːdraɪvər/","n.","螺絲起子","You need a screwdriver to open the panel.","打開面板需要螺絲起子。"],["instrument","/ˈɪnstrəmənt/","n.","儀器、器具","These instruments measure temperature.","這些儀器用來測量溫度。"],["consumables","/kənˈsuːməbəlz/","n.","耗材","Ink and paper are our main consumables.","墨水和紙張是我們的主要耗材。"],["lumber","/ˈlʌmbər/","n.","木材、木料","The lumber was delivered to the site.","木材已經送到工地。"],["copper","/ˈkɑːpər/","n.","銅","Copper prices hit a record high.","銅價創下歷史新高。"],["leather","/ˈleðər/","n.","皮革","The bags are made of real leather.","這些包是真皮製成的。"],["truckload","/ˈtrʌkloʊd/","n.","一卡車的量","Two truckloads of steel arrived today.","今天送來了兩卡車的鋼材。"],["dockworker","/ˈdɑːkwɜːrkər/","n.","碼頭工人","Dockworkers unloaded the ship overnight.","碼頭工人連夜卸船。"],["packer","/ˈpækər/","n.","包裝工","We are hiring packers for the holiday season.","我們正在招募旺季的包裝人員。"],["sorting","/ˈsɔːrtɪŋ/","n.","分類、分揀","Sorting is done by machine now.","現在分揀是由機器完成的。"],["diameter","/daɪˈæmɪtər/","n.","直徑","The pipe has a diameter of ten centimeters.","這根管子的直徑是十公分。"],["thickness","/ˈθɪknəs/","n.","厚度","Check the thickness of each sheet.","檢查每片板材的厚度。"],["depth","/depθ/","n.","深度","The shelf has a depth of 60 centimeters.","架子的深度是六十公分。"],["gallon","/ˈɡælən/","n.","加侖","The tank holds fifty gallons.","這個槽可容納五十加侖。"],["liter","/ˈliːtər/","n.","公升","Each bottle contains one liter of water.","每瓶裝有一公升的水。"],["per unit","/pɜːr ˈjuːnɪt/","phr.","每單位、每件","The price is $5 per unit.","價格是每件五美元。"],["unit cost","/ˈjuːnɪt kɔːst/","n.","單位成本","Larger runs lower the unit cost.","生產量越大，單位成本越低。"],["airfare","/ˈɛrfɛr/","n.","機票費用","Airfare to Singapore has gone up this year.","今年飛新加坡的機票費用上漲了。"],["boarding","/ˈbɔːrdɪŋ/","n.","登機","Boarding will begin thirty minutes before departure.","登機將於起飛前三十分鐘開始。"],["board the plane","/ˌbɔːrd ðə ˈpleɪn/","phr.","登機","Passengers with small children may board the plane first.","帶小孩的乘客可以優先登機。"],["boarding gate","/ˈbɔːrdɪŋ ˌɡeɪt/","n.","登機門","The boarding gate has been changed to B12.","登機門已改為 B12。"],["check-in counter","/ˈtʃɛk ɪn ˌkaʊntɚ/","n.","報到櫃台","The check-in counter closes forty minutes before the flight.","報到櫃台在班機起飛前四十分鐘關閉。"],["baggage","/ˈbæɡɪdʒ/","n.","行李","Each passenger may check two pieces of baggage.","每位乘客可託運兩件行李。"],["checked baggage","/ˌtʃɛkt ˈbæɡɪdʒ/","n.","託運行李","Batteries are not allowed in checked baggage.","託運行李中不得放電池。"],["baggage allowance","/ˈbæɡɪdʒ əˌlaʊəns/","n.","行李限額","The baggage allowance for economy class is 23 kilograms.","經濟艙的行李限額為二十三公斤。"],["excess baggage","/ˌɛksɛs ˈbæɡɪdʒ/","n.","超重行李","You'll be charged a fee for excess baggage.","超重行李將被收取費用。"],["overhead compartment","/ˌoʊvɚhɛd kəmˈpɑːrtmənt/","n.","頭頂置物櫃","Please store your bag in the overhead compartment.","請將您的包包放在頭頂置物櫃。"],["economy class","/ɪˈkɑːnəmi ˌklæs/","n.","經濟艙","Staff must fly economy class on short trips.","短程出差員工須搭乘經濟艙。"],["business class","/ˈbɪznəs ˌklæs/","n.","商務艙","Directors may fly business class on long-haul flights.","董事搭乘長程航班可坐商務艙。"],["first class","/ˌfɝːst ˈklæs/","n.","頭等艙","The first class lounge offers free meals and showers.","頭等艙貴賓室提供免費餐點和淋浴。"],["lounge","/laʊndʒ/","n.","貴賓室、休息室","You can wait in the airport lounge before boarding.","登機前您可以在機場貴賓室等候。"],["direct flight","/dəˌrɛkt ˈflaɪt/","n.","直飛班機","Is there a direct flight from Taipei to Chicago?","有台北直飛芝加哥的班機嗎？"],["nonstop","/ˌnɑːnˈstɑːp/","adj./adv.","直達的、不停靠的","We booked a nonstop flight to save time.","為了節省時間我們訂了直飛班機。"],["stopover","/ˈstɑːpoʊvɚ/","n.","中途停留","We have a one-night stopover in Hong Kong.","我們在香港中途停留一晚。"],["flight number","/ˈflaɪt ˌnʌmbɚ/","n.","班機號碼","Please include your flight number on the form.","請在表格上填寫您的班機號碼。"],["departure lounge","/dɪˈpɑːrtʃɚ ˌlaʊndʒ/","n.","候機室","Passengers are waiting in the departure lounge.","乘客正在候機室等候。"],["arrivals hall","/əˈraɪvəlz ˌhɔːl/","n.","入境大廳","Our driver will be holding a sign in the arrivals hall.","我們的司機會在入境大廳舉牌等候。"],["security check","/sɪˈkjʊrəti ˌtʃɛk/","n.","安全檢查","Allow extra time for the security check.","請預留安檢的額外時間。"],["passport control","/ˈpæspɔːrt kənˌtroʊl/","n.","護照查驗","The line at passport control was very long.","護照查驗處的隊伍非常長。"],["customs declaration","/ˈkʌstəmz dɛkləˌreɪʃən/","n.","海關申報（單）","Please fill out the customs declaration before landing.","降落前請填寫海關申報單。"],["jet lag","/ˈdʒɛt ˌlæɡ/","n.","時差症狀","I'm still suffering from jet lag after the trip.","出差回來後我還在調時差。"],["time difference","/ˈtaɪm ˌdɪfrəns/","n.","時差","Remember the time difference when you call New York.","打電話到紐約時記得考慮時差。"],["long-haul","/ˈlɔːŋ hɔːl/","adj.","長途的","Long-haul flights can be very tiring.","長途飛行可能非常累人。"],["in-flight","/ˈɪn flaɪt/","adj.","飛行中的、機上的","The in-flight entertainment system wasn't working.","機上娛樂系統故障了。"],["runway","/ˈrʌnweɪ/","n.","跑道","The plane is waiting on the runway for clearance.","飛機正在跑道上等待放行。"],["aircraft","/ˈɛrkræft/","n.","飛機、航空器","The aircraft was delayed for a safety inspection.","那架飛機因安全檢查而延誤。"],["cabin","/ˈkæbɪn/","n.","機艙；客艙","Please remain seated until the cabin lights come on.","機艙燈亮起前請留在座位上。"],["turbulence","/ˈtɝːbjələns/","n.","亂流","We experienced some turbulence over the ocean.","我們在海上遇到了一些亂流。"],["round trip","/ˌraʊnd ˈtrɪp/","n.","來回行程","A round trip to Osaka costs about 12,000 dollars.","大阪來回大約一萬兩千元。"],["one-way","/ˌwʌn ˈweɪ/","adj.","單程的","I only need a one-way ticket to Seoul.","我只需要一張到首爾的單程票。"],["e-ticket","/ˈiː ˌtɪkɪt/","n.","電子機票","Your e-ticket has been sent to your email.","您的電子機票已寄到您的電子郵件。"],["travel arrangements","/ˈtrævəl əˌreɪndʒmənts/","n.","差旅安排","My assistant will handle the travel arrangements.","我的助理會處理差旅安排。"],["make arrangements","/ˌmeɪk əˈreɪndʒmənts/","phr.","做安排","Please make arrangements for the visitors' hotel.","請替訪客安排飯店。"],["travel expenses","/ˈtrævəl ɪkˌspɛnsɪz/","n.","差旅費","Keep all receipts for your travel expenses.","請保留所有差旅費收據。"],["book a flight","/ˌbʊk ə ˈflaɪt/","phr.","訂機票","I need to book a flight to Bangkok for Monday.","我需要訂星期一飛曼谷的機票。"],["travel agent","/ˈtrævəl ˌeɪdʒənt/","n.","旅行社專員","Our travel agent found a cheaper fare for us.","我們的旅行社專員幫我們找到更便宜的票價。"],["accommodations","/əˌkɑːməˈdeɪʃənz/","n.","住宿設施","Accommodations will be provided for all speakers.","將為所有講者提供住宿。"],["lodging","/ˈlɑːdʒɪŋ/","n.","住宿","The company covers lodging and meals during the trip.","公司負擔出差期間的住宿與餐費。"],["inn","/ɪn/","n.","小旅館","We stayed at a small inn near the factory.","我們住在工廠附近的一家小旅館。"],["motel","/moʊˈtɛl/","n.","汽車旅館","We spent the night at a motel near the highway.","我們在公路附近的汽車旅館過夜。"],["room rate","/ˈruːm ˌreɪt/","n.","房價","The room rate is lower on weekdays.","平日房價比較低。"],["corporate rate","/ˈkɔːrpərət ˌreɪt/","n.","企業優惠價","Ask the hotel if they offer a corporate rate.","問問飯店有沒有企業優惠價。"],["occupancy rate","/ˈɑːkjəpənsi ˌreɪt/","n.","住房率","The hotel's occupancy rate rose to 90 percent.","飯店住房率上升到百分之九十。"],["overbook","/ˌoʊvɚˈbʊk/","v.","超額預訂","The airline overbooked the flight by ten seats.","航空公司那班機超賣了十個座位。"],["check-out time","/ˈtʃɛk aʊt ˌtaɪm/","n.","退房時間","Check-out time is 11 a.m.","退房時間是上午十一點。"],["late check-out","/ˌleɪt ˈtʃɛk aʊt/","n.","延遲退房","Can I request a late check-out until 2 p.m.?","我可以申請延遲退房到下午兩點嗎？"],["housekeeping","/ˈhaʊskiːpɪŋ/","n.","房務部","Please call housekeeping if you need more towels.","如果需要更多毛巾請聯絡房務部。"],["concierge","/ˌkɑːnsiˈɛrʒ/","n.","禮賓服務員","The concierge can book theater tickets for you.","禮賓人員可以幫您訂劇院票。"],["bellhop","/ˈbɛlhɑːp/","n.","行李員","The bellhop carried our bags to the room.","行李員把我們的行李提到房間。"],["valet parking","/ˈvæleɪ ˌpɑːrkɪŋ/","n.","代客泊車","Valet parking is available at the main entrance.","正門口提供代客泊車服務。"],["minibar","/ˈmɪnibɑːr/","n.","（客房）迷你吧","Items from the minibar will be added to your bill.","迷你吧的消費會加到您的帳單上。"],["do not disturb","/ˌduː nɑːt dɪˈstɝːb/","phr.","請勿打擾","Hang the \"do not disturb\" sign on your door.","把「請勿打擾」的牌子掛在門上。"],["business center","/ˈbɪznəs ˌsɛntɚ/","n.","（飯店）商務中心","You can print documents in the business center.","您可以在商務中心列印文件。"],["complimentary breakfast","/ˌkɑːmplɪˌmɛntəri ˈbrɛkfəst/","n.","免費早餐","All guests receive a complimentary breakfast.","所有房客都享有免費早餐。"],["room key","/ˈruːm ˌkiː/","n.","房間鑰匙","I left my room key at the front desk.","我把房間鑰匙留在櫃台了。"],["deluxe","/dəˈlʌks/","adj.","豪華的","We upgraded the CEO to a deluxe room.","我們把執行長升級到豪華客房。"],["lodge","/lɑːdʒ/","n./v.","山中小屋；住宿","The team stayed at a lodge in the mountains.","團隊住在山中的一間小屋。"],["hostess","/ˈhoʊstəs/","n.","（餐廳）帶位員；女主人","The hostess showed us to our table.","帶位員帶我們到座位。"],["dine","/daɪn/","v.","用餐","We dined at a seafood restaurant by the harbor.","我們在港邊一家海鮮餐廳用餐。"],["dining room","/ˈdaɪnɪŋ ˌruːm/","n.","餐廳；飯廳","The dining room can seat up to eighty guests.","餐廳最多可容納八十位客人。"],["eat out","/ˌiːt ˈaʊt/","phr.","在外面吃飯","We usually eat out when we visit clients.","拜訪客戶時我們通常在外面吃飯。"],["dine in","/ˌdaɪn ˈɪn/","phr.","內用","Customers who dine in get free refills.","內用的顧客可免費續杯。"],["to go","/tə ˈɡoʊ/","phr.","外帶","I'll have a coffee to go, please.","我要一杯咖啡外帶。"],["entree","/ˈɑːntreɪ/","n.","主菜","Each guest may choose chicken or fish as the entree.","每位賓客可選雞肉或魚作為主菜。"],["side dish","/ˈsaɪd ˌdɪʃ/","n.","配菜","The steak comes with two side dishes.","牛排附兩道配菜。"],["portion","/ˈpɔːrʃən/","n.","（食物的）一份","The portions at this restaurant are very large.","這家餐廳的份量很大。"],["serving","/ˈsɝːvɪŋ/","n.","一份（食物）","This recipe makes about twelve servings.","這道食譜大約可做十二人份。"],["today's special","/təˌdeɪz ˈspɛʃəl/","n.","今日特餐","Today's special is beef noodle soup.","今日特餐是牛肉麵。"],["set menu","/ˌsɛt ˈmɛnjuː/","n.","套餐菜單","The set menu includes a starter, main course, and dessert.","套餐包括前菜、主菜和甜點。"],["a la carte","/ˌɑː lɑː ˈkɑːrt/","adj./adv.","單點的","You can also order dishes a la carte.","您也可以單點菜色。"],["vegetarian option","/ˌvɛdʒəˈtɛriən ˌɑːpʃən/","n.","素食選項","Please let us know if you need a vegetarian option.","若需要素食選項請告訴我們。"],["dietary restrictions","/ˈdaɪətɛri rɪˌstrɪkʃənz/","n.","飲食限制","Please note any dietary restrictions on the registration form.","請在報名表上註明任何飲食限制。"],["food allergy","/ˈfuːd ˌælɚdʒi/","n.","食物過敏","Tell your server about any food allergies.","有任何食物過敏請告知服務生。"],["seafood","/ˈsiːfuːd/","n.","海鮮","The restaurant is famous for its fresh seafood.","那家餐廳以新鮮海鮮聞名。"],["condiment","/ˈkɑːndɪmənt/","n.","調味料","Condiments are available at the self-service counter.","調味料放在自助櫃台。"],["utensils","/juːˈtɛnsəlz/","n.","餐具","Plastic utensils will be provided for the picnic.","野餐會提供塑膠餐具。"],["tablecloth","/ˈteɪbəlklɔːθ/","n.","桌布","White tablecloths were placed on every table.","每張桌子都鋪上了白色桌布。"],["pitcher","/ˈpɪtʃɚ/","n.","水壺","A waiter is filling glasses from a pitcher.","一位服務生正用水壺倒水到杯子裡。"],["patio","/ˈpætioʊ/","n.","露台、庭院","We'd like to sit outside on the patio.","我們想坐在外面的露台。"],["outdoor seating","/ˌaʊtdɔːr ˈsiːtɪŋ/","n.","戶外座位","The cafe has outdoor seating in summer.","這家咖啡館夏天有戶外座位。"],["make a reservation","/ˌmeɪk ə ˌrɛzɚˈveɪʃən/","phr.","預約、訂位","I'd like to make a reservation for Friday night.","我想預約星期五晚上。"],["private room","/ˌpraɪvət ˈruːm/","n.","包廂","We booked a private room for the client dinner.","我們為客戶晚宴訂了包廂。"],["split the check","/ˌsplɪt ðə ˈtʃɛk/","phr.","分開付帳","Would you like to split the check?","您要分開付帳嗎？"],["leftover","/ˈlɛftoʊvɚ/","adj.","剩下的","We packed the leftover food in boxes.","我們把剩菜裝進盒子裡。"],["doggy bag","/ˈdɔːɡi ˌbæɡ/","n.","打包袋","Could I get a doggy bag for this?","這個可以幫我打包嗎？"],["caterer","/ˈkeɪtərɚ/","n.","外燴業者","We hired a caterer for the company picnic.","我們為公司野餐請了外燴業者。"],["catering service","/ˈkeɪtərɪŋ ˌsɝːvɪs/","n.","外燴服務","The hotel offers catering services for meetings.","飯店提供會議外燴服務。"],["food and beverage","/ˌfuːd ən ˈbɛvərɪdʒ/","n.","餐飲","She manages the hotel's food and beverage department.","她管理飯店的餐飲部。"],["light refreshments","/ˌlaɪt rɪˈfrɛʃmənts/","n.","簡單茶點","Light refreshments will be served after the talk.","演講後將提供簡單茶點。"],["convention center","/kənˈvɛnʃən ˌsɛntɚ/","n.","會議中心","The trade fair is held at the convention center.","商展在會議中心舉行。"],["exhibition hall","/ˌɛksɪˈbɪʃən ˌhɔːl/","n.","展覽館","Exhibition Hall B is reserved for machinery.","展覽館 B 館專門展示機械。"],["trade fair","/ˈtreɪd ˌfɛr/","n.","貿易博覽會","The trade fair attracts buyers from over fifty countries.","這場貿易博覽會吸引了來自五十多國的買家。"],["exhibitor","/ɪɡˈzɪbɪtɚ/","n.","參展商","Exhibitors must set up their booths by 8 a.m.","參展商須在早上八點前完成攤位布置。"],["expo","/ˈɛkspoʊ/","n.","博覽會","The tech expo runs for three days in October.","這場科技博覽會在十月舉辦三天。"],["floor plan","/ˈflɔːr ˌplæn/","n.","平面圖","Check the floor plan to find our booth.","查看平面圖找我們的攤位。"],["display stand","/dɪˈspleɪ ˌstænd/","n.","展示架","Our new tools are on the display stand.","我們的新刀具放在展示架上。"],["set up a booth","/ˌsɛt ʌp ə ˈbuːθ/","phr.","設置攤位","It took us four hours to set up the booth.","我們花了四小時布置攤位。"],["free sample","/ˌfriː ˈsæmpəl/","n.","免費樣品","We handed out free samples at the expo.","我們在博覽會上發送免費樣品。"],["visitor pass","/ˈvɪzɪtɚ ˌpæs/","n.","訪客證","Please show your visitor pass at the entrance.","請在入口出示訪客證。"],["admission ticket","/ədˈmɪʃən ˌtɪkɪt/","n.","入場券","Admission tickets can be bought online.","入場券可在網路上購買。"],["entrance fee","/ˈɛntrəns ˌfiː/","n.","入場費","The entrance fee is waived for registered buyers.","已登記的買家免收入場費。"],["registration fee","/ˌrɛdʒɪˈstreɪʃən ˌfiː/","n.","報名費","The registration fee covers all sessions and lunch.","報名費包含所有場次及午餐。"],["early registration","/ˌɝːli ˌrɛdʒɪˈstreɪʃən/","n.","早鳥報名","Early registration ends on May 31.","早鳥報名於五月三十一日截止。"],["early-bird discount","/ˈɝːli bɝːd ˌdɪskaʊnt/","n.","早鳥優惠","Sign up now to get the early-bird discount.","現在報名可享早鳥優惠。"],["session","/ˈsɛʃən/","n.","（會議）場次、時段","The afternoon session will focus on new materials.","下午場次將聚焦於新材料。"],["breakout session","/ˈbreɪkaʊt ˌsɛʃən/","n.","分組會議","Attendees can choose from four breakout sessions.","與會者可從四場分組會議中選擇。"],["panel discussion","/ˈpænəl dɪˌskʌʃən/","n.","座談會","The panel discussion featured three industry experts.","座談會邀請了三位業界專家。"],["guest speaker","/ˌɡɛst ˈspiːkɚ/","n.","特邀講者","Our guest speaker is a well-known engineer.","我們的特邀講者是一位知名工程師。"],["keynote speaker","/ˈkiːnoʊt ˌspiːkɚ/","n.","主講人","The keynote speaker will talk about smart factories.","主講人將談論智慧工廠。"],["master of ceremonies","/ˌmæstɚ əv ˈsɛrəmoʊniz/","n.","司儀","The master of ceremonies introduced each speaker.","司儀介紹了每位講者。"],["opening remarks","/ˌoʊpənɪŋ rɪˈmɑːrks/","n.","開幕致詞","The president will give the opening remarks.","總裁將發表開幕致詞。"],["closing ceremony","/ˌkloʊzɪŋ ˈsɛrəmoʊni/","n.","閉幕典禮","Awards will be presented at the closing ceremony.","頒獎將在閉幕典禮上進行。"],["award ceremony","/əˈwɔːrd ˌsɛrəmoʊni/","n.","頒獎典禮","The award ceremony starts at 6 p.m.","頒獎典禮晚上六點開始。"],["gathering","/ˈɡæðərɪŋ/","n.","聚會","The annual gathering brings together all our partners.","年度聚會匯集了我們所有的合作夥伴。"],["get-together","/ˈɡɛt təˌɡɛðɚ/","n.","聚會","We're having a small get-together after work.","我們下班後有個小聚會。"],["year-end party","/ˌjɪr ɛnd ˈpɑːrti/","n.","尾牙","The year-end party will be held at a hotel downtown.","尾牙將在市中心的飯店舉行。"],["launch event","/ˈlɔːntʃ ɪˌvɛnt/","n.","發表會","Journalists were invited to the product launch event.","記者受邀參加產品發表會。"],["event planner","/ɪˈvɛnt ˌplænɚ/","n.","活動企劃","The event planner chose a venue near the airport.","活動企劃選了一個靠近機場的場地。"],["organizer","/ˈɔːrɡənaɪzɚ/","n.","主辦者、籌辦人","The organizers expect over 2,000 visitors.","主辦單位預計超過兩千名參觀者。"],["press conference","/ˈprɛs ˌkɑːnfərəns/","n.","記者會","The company held a press conference to announce the merger.","公司召開記者會宣布合併。"],["annual conference","/ˌænjuəl ˈkɑːnfərəns/","n.","年會","The annual conference will be held in Kaohsiung this year.","今年的年會將在高雄舉行。"],["attend a conference","/əˌtɛnd ə ˈkɑːnfərəns/","phr.","參加會議","I'll attend a conference in Berlin next month.","我下個月要去柏林參加一場會議。"],["sold-out","/ˌsoʊld ˈaʊt/","adj.","售罄的","The concert was a sold-out show.","那場音樂會門票全數售罄。"],["box office","/ˈbɑːks ˌɔːfɪs/","n.","售票處；票房","Tickets can be picked up at the box office.","門票可以在售票處領取。"],["matinee","/ˌmætəˈneɪ/","n.","日場演出","The matinee starts at 2 p.m. on Sunday.","日場演出於星期日下午兩點開始。"],["intermission","/ˌɪntɚˈmɪʃən/","n.","中場休息","Drinks will be sold during the intermission.","中場休息時會販售飲料。"],["premiere","/prɪˈmɪr/","n.","首映、首演","The film's premiere will take place in Taipei.","這部電影的首映將在台北舉行。"],["orchestra","/ˈɔːrkɪstrə/","n.","管弦樂團","The city orchestra performs every Friday evening.","市立管弦樂團每週五晚上演出。"],["musician","/mjuˈzɪʃən/","n.","音樂家","Local musicians will play at the reception.","在地音樂家將在酒會上演奏。"],["applause","/əˈplɔːz/","n.","掌聲","The speech ended with loud applause.","演講在熱烈掌聲中結束。"],["amusement park","/əˈmjuːzmənt ˌpɑːrk/","n.","遊樂園","The company rented an amusement park for Family Day.","公司包下了遊樂園舉辦家庭日。"],["attraction","/əˈtrækʃən/","n.","景點；吸引力","The night market is a popular tourist attraction.","夜市是熱門的觀光景點。"],["tourist attraction","/ˈtʊrɪst əˌtrækʃən/","n.","觀光景點","Taipei 101 is a famous tourist attraction.","台北 101 是著名的觀光景點。"],["scenic","/ˈsiːnɪk/","adj.","風景優美的","We took the scenic route along the coast.","我們走了沿海的風景路線。"],["historic site","/hɪˌstɔːrɪk ˈsaɪt/","n.","古蹟","The tour includes several historic sites.","這趟導覽包含幾處古蹟。"],["local cuisine","/ˌloʊkəl kwɪˈziːn/","n.","在地料理","Visitors love trying the local cuisine.","遊客喜歡品嚐在地料理。"],["excursion","/ɪkˈskɝːʒən/","n.","短程旅行、遠足","An optional excursion to the hot springs is offered.","提供前往溫泉的自由參加行程。"],["day trip","/ˈdeɪ ˌtrɪp/","n.","一日遊","We took a day trip to the old town.","我們去老城區一日遊。"],["tour operator","/ˈtʊr ˌɑːpəreɪtɚ/","n.","旅遊業者","The tour operator canceled the trip due to the typhoon.","旅遊業者因颱風取消了行程。"],["peak season","/ˈpiːk ˌsiːzən/","n.","旺季","Hotel prices are higher during peak season.","旺季期間飯店價格較高。"],["off-season","/ˈɔːf ˌsiːzən/","n./adj.","淡季（的）","Off-season rates are about 30 percent cheaper.","淡季價格大約便宜三成。"],["high season","/ˈhaɪ ˌsiːzən/","n.","旺季","Book early if you travel during the high season.","如果在旺季旅行請提早預訂。"],["travel insurance","/ˈtrævəl ɪnˌʃʊrəns/","n.","旅遊保險","The company provides travel insurance for business trips.","公司為出差提供旅遊保險。"],["fare card","/ˈfɛr ˌkɑːrd/","n.","交通儲值卡","Tap your fare card when you enter the station.","進站時請感應交通儲值卡。"],["mass transit","/ˌmæs ˈtrænzɪt/","n.","大眾運輸系統","The city is expanding its mass transit system.","這個城市正在擴建大眾運輸系統。"],["rush hour","/ˈrʌʃ ˌaʊɚ/","n.","尖峰時段","Avoid driving downtown during rush hour.","尖峰時段避免開車進市區。"],["express train","/ɪkˈsprɛs ˌtreɪn/","n.","快車","The express train only stops at major stations.","快車只停靠大站。"],["high-speed rail","/ˌhaɪ spiːd ˈreɪl/","n.","高鐵","Taking the high-speed rail saves a lot of time.","搭高鐵可以節省很多時間。"],["local train","/ˈloʊkəl ˌtreɪn/","n.","區間車","The local train stops at every station.","區間車每站都停。"],["conductor","/kənˈdʌktɚ/","n.","列車長；指揮","The conductor checked our tickets on the train.","列車長在車上查了我們的票。"],["route map","/ˈruːt ˌmæp/","n.","路線圖","A subway route map is posted at every station.","每個車站都貼有地鐵路線圖。"],["taxi stand","/ˈtæksi ˌstænd/","n.","計程車招呼站","The taxi stand is just outside Exit 3.","計程車招呼站就在三號出口外。"],["car rental","/ˈkɑːr ˌrɛntəl/","n.","租車","The car rental desk is on the ground floor.","租車櫃台在一樓。"],["pick-up","/ˈpɪk ʌp/","n.","接送","Hotel staff will arrange your airport pick-up.","飯店人員會安排您的機場接機。"],["drop-off","/ˈdrɑːp ɔːf/","n.","下車處；送達","The drop-off area is in front of Terminal 1.","下車區在第一航廈前面。"],["toll","/toʊl/","n.","通行費","The highway toll is charged automatically.","高速公路通行費自動扣款。"],["fuel surcharge","/ˈfjuːəl ˌsɝːtʃɑːrdʒ/","n.","燃油附加費","The ticket price includes a fuel surcharge.","票價包含燃油附加費。"],["departure time","/dɪˈpɑːrtʃɚ ˌtaɪm/","n.","出發時間","The departure time has been moved to 9:15.","出發時間已改到九點十五分。"],["arrival time","/əˈraɪvəl ˌtaɪm/","n.","抵達時間","What is the estimated arrival time in Tokyo?","預計幾點抵達東京？"],["be delayed","/ˌbiː dɪˈleɪd/","phr.","延誤","Our flight was delayed by two hours.","我們的班機延誤了兩小時。"],["be canceled","/ˌbiː ˈkænsəld/","phr.","被取消","All flights were canceled because of the storm.","所有班機都因暴風雨而取消。"],["rebook","/ˌriːˈbʊk/","v.","重新預訂","The airline rebooked us on the next flight.","航空公司幫我們改訂下一班飛機。"],["waiting list","/ˈweɪtɪŋ ˌlɪst/","n.","候補名單","I'm on the waiting list for an earlier flight.","我在較早班機的候補名單上。"],["standby","/ˈstændbaɪ/","adj./n.","候補（的）","He got a standby seat on the evening flight.","他拿到了晚班的候補座位。"],["lost and found","/ˌlɔːst ən ˈfaʊnd/","n.","失物招領處","Check the lost and found for your umbrella.","去失物招領處找找你的傘。"],["carousel","/ˌkærəˈsɛl/","n.","行李轉盤","Bags from Flight 207 will arrive at Carousel 3.","207 班機的行李將在三號轉盤出來。"],["suburb","/ˈsʌbɜːrb/","n.","郊區","Many employees live in the suburbs and commute.","許多員工住在郊區通勤上班。"],["furnished","/ˈfɜːrnɪʃt/","adj.","附家具的","The furnished apartment is available from May.","這間附家具的公寓五月起可入住。"],["homeowner","/ˈhoʊmoʊnər/","n.","屋主","Homeowners must get a permit for major repairs.","屋主進行大型修繕須申請許可。"],["occupant","/ˈɑːkjəpənt/","n.","居住者、使用者","The previous occupant left the office very clean.","前一位使用者把辦公室留得很乾淨。"],["residential","/ˌrezɪˈdenʃl/","adj.","住宅的","This is a quiet residential area.","這是一個安靜的住宅區。"],["condominium","/ˌkɑːndəˈmɪniəm/","n.","公寓大廈（產權獨立）","They bought a condominium near the river.","他們在河邊買了一間公寓。"],["studio","/ˈstuːdioʊ/","n.","套房；工作室","The studio is ideal for a single professional.","這間套房很適合單身上班族。"],["one-bedroom","/ˌwʌn ˈbedruːm/","adj.","一房的","A one-bedroom apartment rents for $1,200 a month.","一房公寓每月租金一千二百美元。"],["townhouse","/ˈtaʊnhaʊs/","n.","連棟透天屋","The developer is building 30 new townhouses.","開發商正在興建三十棟新的連棟屋。"],["realtor","/ˈriːəltər/","n.","房地產經紀人","Our realtor showed us five offices today.","我們的房仲今天帶我們看了五間辦公室。"],["real estate agent","/ˈriːəl ɪˌsteɪt ˈeɪdʒənt/","phr.","房地產仲介","A real estate agent will contact you shortly.","房仲很快會與您聯繫。"],["property manager","/ˈprɑːpərti ˌmænɪdʒər/","phr.","物業經理","Report any problems to the property manager.","有任何問題請向物業經理反映。"],["building manager","/ˈbɪldɪŋ ˌmænɪdʒər/","phr.","大樓管理員、大樓經理","The building manager will check the heating system.","大樓經理會檢查暖氣系統。"],["listing","/ˈlɪstɪŋ/","n.","（房地產）待售或待租物件","The new listing includes a two-car garage.","這個新物件附有雙車位車庫。"],["open house","/ˌoʊpən ˈhaʊs/","phr.","開放參觀日","The agent is holding an open house on Sunday.","仲介週日將舉辦開放參觀。"],["security deposit","/sɪˈkjʊrəti dɪˌpɑːzɪt/","phr.","押金、保證金","The security deposit equals two months' rent.","押金相當於兩個月的租金。"],["lease agreement","/ˈliːs əˌɡriːmənt/","phr.","租賃契約","Please read the lease agreement carefully before signing.","簽約前請仔細閱讀租約。"],["lease term","/ˈliːs tɜːrm/","phr.","租期","The lease term is two years.","租期為兩年。"],["rent increase","/ˈrent ˌɪnkriːs/","phr.","漲租","Tenants were notified of a 5 percent rent increase.","房客收到漲租百分之五的通知。"],["utilities","/juːˈtɪlətiz/","n.","水電瓦斯等公用事業","Utilities are not included in the rent.","房租不含水電瓦斯費。"],["move-in date","/ˈmuːv ɪn deɪt/","phr.","入住日期","What is the earliest move-in date?","最早什麼時候可以入住？"],["expiration","/ˌekspəˈreɪʃn/","n.","到期、期滿","Please note the expiration date of your lease.","請留意您租約的到期日。"],["sublet","/ˌsʌbˈlet/","v.","轉租","Tenants may not sublet without permission.","未經許可，房客不得轉租。"],["convenience","/kənˈviːniəns/","n.","便利、方便","For your convenience, parking is free.","為了您的方便，停車免費。"],["close to","/ˈkloʊs tuː/","phr.","靠近","The office is close to the subway station.","辦公室靠近地鐵站。"],["cramped","/kræmpt/","adj.","狹窄的、擁擠的","The old office was too cramped for twenty people.","舊辦公室對二十個人來說太擠了。"],["attic","/ˈætɪk/","n.","閣樓","Old records are stored in the attic.","舊紀錄存放在閣樓。"],["corridor","/ˈkɔːrɪdɔːr/","n.","走廊","The copy room is at the end of the corridor.","影印室在走廊盡頭。"],["escalator","/ˈeskəleɪtər/","n.","手扶梯","The escalator is closed for maintenance.","手扶梯因維修暫停使用。"],["stairwell","/ˈsterwel/","n.","樓梯間","Do not store boxes in the stairwell.","請勿在樓梯間堆放箱子。"],["freight elevator","/ˈfreɪt ˌelɪveɪtər/","phr.","貨梯","Please use the freight elevator for deliveries.","送貨請使用貨梯。"],["ramp","/ræmp/","n.","坡道","A ramp was added at the main entrance.","主要入口加設了一條坡道。"],["handrail","/ˈhændreɪl/","n.","扶手","Please hold the handrail on the stairs.","走樓梯時請握好扶手。"],["wheelchair accessible","/ˈwiːltʃer əkˌsesəbl/","phr.","輪椅可通行的","All meeting rooms are wheelchair accessible.","所有會議室都可供輪椅通行。"],["accessibility","/əkˌsesəˈbɪləti/","n.","無障礙；可及性","The renovation will improve accessibility for visitors.","翻修將改善訪客的無障礙通行。"],["wing","/wɪŋ/","n.","（建築物的）側翼","The accounting team is in the east wing.","會計團隊在東側大樓。"],["branch office","/ˈbræntʃ ˌɔːfɪs/","phr.","分公司、分處","We are opening a branch office in Taichung.","我們將在台中開設分公司。"],["workspace","/ˈwɜːrkspeɪs/","n.","工作空間","Keep your workspace clean and tidy.","請保持工作空間整潔。"],["open-plan","/ˌoʊpən ˈplæn/","adj.","開放式的","The company moved to an open-plan office.","公司搬到了開放式辦公室。"],["partition","/pɑːrˈtɪʃn/","n.","隔板、隔間","Glass partitions separate the meeting areas.","玻璃隔板把會議區隔開。"],["square foot","/ˌskwer ˈfʊt/","phr.","平方英尺","Rent is $30 per square foot per year.","租金每年每平方英尺三十美元。"],["square footage","/ˌskwer ˈfʊtɪdʒ/","phr.","面積（平方英尺數）","What is the total square footage of the warehouse?","倉庫的總面積是多少？"],["office furniture","/ˈɔːfɪs ˌfɜːrnɪtʃər/","phr.","辦公家具","New office furniture will arrive on Monday.","新的辦公家具週一送達。"],["filing cabinet","/ˈfaɪlɪŋ ˌkæbɪnət/","phr.","檔案櫃","Contracts are kept in the locked filing cabinet.","合約存放在上鎖的檔案櫃裡。"],["electrician","/ɪˌlekˈtrɪʃn/","n.","電工、水電師傅","An electrician is fixing the wiring in the lobby.","電工正在修理大廳的線路。"],["handyman","/ˈhændimæn/","n.","雜工、修繕工","The handyman fixed the broken shelf in minutes.","修繕工幾分鐘就修好了壞掉的架子。"],["janitor","/ˈdʒænɪtər/","n.","清潔工、工友","Ask the janitor to mop the wet floor.","請工友把濕地板拖乾。"],["locksmith","/ˈlɑːksmɪθ/","n.","鎖匠","We called a locksmith to open the safe.","我們叫了鎖匠來打開保險箱。"],["cleaning crew","/ˈkliːnɪŋ kruː/","phr.","清潔人員","The cleaning crew comes in after 6 p.m.","清潔人員晚上六點後進來。"],["maintenance request","/ˈmeɪntənəns rɪˌkwest/","phr.","維修申請","Submit a maintenance request through the online portal.","請透過線上平台提交維修申請。"],["out of service","/ˌaʊt əv ˈsɜːrvɪs/","phr.","停止使用、暫停服務","The east elevator is out of service until Friday.","東側電梯停用到週五。"],["fix up","/ˌfɪks ˈʌp/","phr.","整修、修理","They fixed up the old warehouse as a showroom.","他們把舊倉庫整修成展示間。"],["touch up","/ˌtʌtʃ ˈʌp/","phr.","修補、潤飾","Painters will touch up the walls this weekend.","油漆工這週末會修補牆面。"],["leaky","/ˈliːki/","adj.","漏水的","Please report the leaky faucet to maintenance.","請向維修部回報漏水的水龍頭。"],["drip","/drɪp/","v./n.","滴水；滴","Water is dripping from the air conditioner.","冷氣機在滴水。"],["faucet","/ˈfɔːsɪt/","n.","水龍頭","The faucet in the restroom won't turn off.","洗手間的水龍頭關不起來。"],["drain","/dreɪn/","n./v.","排水管；排水","The drain in the kitchen is slow.","廚房的排水很慢。"],["clogged","/klɑːɡd/","adj.","堵塞的","The sink is clogged with coffee grounds.","水槽被咖啡渣塞住了。"],["plumbing","/ˈplʌmɪŋ/","n.","管線系統；水管工程","The building's plumbing is over 40 years old.","這棟樓的水管已經超過四十年了。"],["water damage","/ˈwɔːtər ˌdæmɪdʒ/","phr.","水損、泡水損壞","The flood caused serious water damage to the files.","洪水讓文件嚴重泡水受損。"],["pest control","/ˈpest kənˌtroʊl/","phr.","除蟲、病媒防治","Pest control will spray the building on Saturday.","除蟲公司週六將在大樓噴藥。"],["tighten","/ˈtaɪtn/","v.","鎖緊、拉緊","He tightened the screws on the table legs.","他把桌腳的螺絲鎖緊。"],["extension cord","/ɪkˈstenʃn kɔːrd/","phr.","延長線","Don't connect the heater to an extension cord.","暖氣機不要接延長線。"],["power strip","/ˈpaʊər strɪp/","phr.","電源排插","Plug the monitors into the power strip.","把螢幕插到排插上。"],["power cord","/ˈpaʊər kɔːrd/","phr.","電源線","The power cord is too short to reach the outlet.","電源線太短，接不到插座。"],["adapter","/əˈdæptər/","n.","轉接器","Bring an adapter for the projector.","請帶投影機的轉接頭。"],["lighting","/ˈlaɪtɪŋ/","n.","照明","The new LED lighting saves a lot of energy.","新的 LED 照明省下大量能源。"],["flicker","/ˈflɪkər/","v.","閃爍","The lights in Room B keep flickering.","B 室的燈一直閃爍。"],["wiring","/ˈwaɪərɪŋ/","n.","配線、線路","Faulty wiring caused the power failure.","線路故障導致停電。"],["blackout","/ˈblækaʊt/","n.","大停電","The storm caused a blackout across the city.","暴風雨造成全市大停電。"],["shut off","/ˌʃʌt ˈɔːf/","phr.","關閉；切斷","Water will be shut off during the repairs.","維修期間將會停水。"],["energy-efficient","/ˈenərdʒi ɪˌfɪʃnt/","adj.","節能的","We replaced the old lights with energy-efficient ones.","我們把舊燈換成了節能燈具。"],["energy consumption","/ˈenərdʒi kənˌsʌmpʃn/","phr.","能源消耗","We want to cut energy consumption by 15 percent.","我們希望把能耗減少百分之十五。"],["save energy","/ˌseɪv ˈenərdʒi/","phr.","節省能源","Turn off your monitor to save energy.","關掉螢幕以節省能源。"],["solar panel","/ˈsoʊlər ˌpænl/","phr.","太陽能板","Solar panels were installed on the roof.","屋頂上裝設了太陽能板。"],["thermostat","/ˈθɜːrməstæt/","n.","恆溫器、溫控器","Please don't change the thermostat setting.","請不要更改溫控器的設定。"],["carpet","/ˈkɑːrpɪt/","n.","地毯","The carpet will be cleaned over the weekend.","地毯將在週末清洗。"],["tile","/taɪl/","n.","磁磚、瓷磚","The bathroom floor has new tiles.","浴室地板換了新磁磚。"],["flooring","/ˈflɔːrɪŋ/","n.","地板材料","We chose wood flooring for the reception area.","我們為接待區選了木地板。"],["wallpaper","/ˈwɔːlpeɪpər/","n.","壁紙；桌布","The old wallpaper was removed last week.","舊壁紙上週已經拆除了。"],["repaint","/ˌriːˈpeɪnt/","v.","重新粉刷","The hallway will be repainted next month.","走廊下個月要重新粉刷。"],["interior design","/ɪnˌtɪriər dɪˈzaɪn/","phr.","室內設計","The firm specializes in office interior design.","這家公司專精辦公室室內設計。"],["renovate","/ˈrenəveɪt/","v.","翻修、整修","The hotel will renovate all its guest rooms.","飯店將翻修所有客房。"],["renovated","/ˈrenəveɪtɪd/","adj.","翻修過的","The newly renovated lobby opens on Monday.","新翻修的大廳週一啟用。"],["remodel","/ˌriːˈmɑːdl/","v.","改建、重新裝修","They are remodeling the kitchen on the third floor.","他們正在改建三樓的廚房。"],["well-maintained","/ˌwel meɪnˈteɪnd/","adj.","維護良好的","The building is old but well-maintained.","這棟大樓雖舊但維護得很好。"],["run-down","/ˌrʌn ˈdaʊn/","adj.","破舊的、失修的","The company bought a run-down hotel and restored it.","公司買下一家破舊旅館並加以修復。"],["modernize","/ˈmɑːdərnaɪz/","v.","使現代化","We need to modernize our computer systems.","我們需要讓電腦系統現代化。"],["construction site","/kənˈstrʌkʃn saɪt/","phr.","工地","Hard hats must be worn at the construction site.","在工地必須戴安全帽。"],["under construction","/ˌʌndər kənˈstrʌkʃn/","phr.","施工中","The new wing is still under construction.","新的側翼大樓仍在施工中。"],["construction worker","/kənˈstrʌkʃn ˌwɜːrkər/","phr.","建築工人","Construction workers are pouring concrete.","建築工人正在灌漿。"],["concrete","/ˈkɑːŋkriːt/","n./adj.","混凝土；具體的","The workers are pouring concrete for the foundation.","工人正在為地基灌混凝土。"],["road work","/ˈroʊd wɜːrk/","phr.","道路施工","Road work may delay your commute this week.","本週道路施工可能讓您通勤延誤。"],["blueprints","/ˈbluːprɪnts/","n.","藍圖、設計圖","The architect reviewed the blueprints with us.","建築師和我們一起檢視藍圖。"],["architecture","/ˈɑːrkɪtektʃər/","n.","建築（學、風格）","The city is famous for its modern architecture.","這座城市以現代建築聞名。"],["wireless","/ˈwaɪərləs/","adj.","無線的","The conference room has a wireless projector.","會議室有一台無線投影機。"],["router","/ˈraʊtər/","n.","路由器","Try restarting the router if the internet is slow.","網路慢的話試著重新啟動路由器。"],["operating system","/ˈɑːpəreɪtɪŋ ˌsɪstəm/","phr.","作業系統","All laptops will get the new operating system.","所有筆電都將安裝新作業系統。"],["settings","/ˈsetɪŋz/","n.","設定","You can change the language in the settings menu.","您可以在設定選單中更改語言。"],["profile","/ˈproʊfaɪl/","n.","個人資料、簡介","Update your profile with your new phone number.","請在個人資料中更新新的電話號碼。"],["password reset","/ˈpæswɜːrd ˌriːset/","phr.","密碼重設","Contact IT for a password reset.","請聯絡資訊部重設密碼。"],["freeze","/friːz/","v.","當機、凍結；凍結（價格）","My screen froze in the middle of the presentation.","我的螢幕在簡報途中當機了。"],["error message","/ˈerər ˌmesɪdʒ/","phr.","錯誤訊息","I keep getting an error message when I log in.","我登入時一直出現錯誤訊息。"],["pop-up","/ˈpɑːp ʌp/","n./adj.","彈出視窗","Close the pop-up to continue.","關閉彈出視窗以繼續。"],["alert","/əˈlɜːrt/","n./v.","警示；提醒","The system sent an alert about unusual activity.","系統發出了異常活動的警示。"],["icon","/ˈaɪkɑːn/","n.","圖示","Click the printer icon at the top of the page.","點擊頁面上方的印表機圖示。"],["drop-down menu","/ˈdrɑːp daʊn ˌmenjuː/","phr.","下拉式選單","Choose your department from the drop-down menu.","請從下拉式選單選擇您的部門。"],["copy and paste","/ˌkɑːpi ən ˈpeɪst/","phr.","複製貼上","Copy and paste the link into your browser.","把連結複製貼上到瀏覽器。"],["shortcut","/ˈʃɔːrtkʌt/","n.","捷徑；快速鍵","Create a shortcut to the shared folder on your desktop.","在桌面上建立共用資料夾的捷徑。"],["format","/ˈfɔːrmæt/","n./v.","格式；格式化","Please send the report in PDF format.","請以 PDF 格式寄送報告。"],["hard drive","/ˈhɑːrd draɪv/","phr.","硬碟","Don't save personal files on the hard drive.","不要把個人檔案存在硬碟裡。"],["flash drive","/ˈflæʃ draɪv/","phr.","隨身碟","Copy the presentation onto a flash drive.","把簡報複製到隨身碟。"],["memory","/ˈmeməri/","n.","記憶體；記憶","This laptop needs more memory to run faster.","這台筆電需要更多記憶體才會跑得快。"],["shared drive","/ˌʃerd ˈdraɪv/","phr.","共用磁碟","The templates are saved on the shared drive.","範本存放在共用磁碟。"],["cloud storage","/ˈklaʊd ˌstɔːrɪdʒ/","phr.","雲端儲存","We moved all our files to cloud storage.","我們把所有檔案都移到雲端儲存。"],["back up","/ˌbæk ˈʌp/","phr.","備份","Back up your files before the system upgrade.","系統升級前請備份檔案。"],["tech support","/ˈtek səˌpɔːrt/","phr.","技術支援","Tech support solved the problem in ten minutes.","技術支援十分鐘就解決了問題。"],["IT department","/ˌaɪ ˈtiː dɪˌpɑːrtmənt/","phr.","資訊部門","The IT department will install the new software.","資訊部將安裝新軟體。"],["technical issue","/ˈteknɪkl ˌɪʃuː/","phr.","技術問題","The webinar was delayed due to a technical issue.","網路研討會因技術問題延後。"],["technical difficulties","/ˈteknɪkl ˌdɪfɪkəltiz/","phr.","技術故障","We apologize for the technical difficulties.","對於技術上的問題我們深感抱歉。"],["uninstall","/ˌʌnɪnˈstɔːl/","v.","解除安裝","Uninstall the old version before installing the new one.","安裝新版前請先移除舊版。"],["software update","/ˈsɔːftwer ˌʌpdeɪt/","phr.","軟體更新","A software update is available for your device.","您的裝置有可用的軟體更新。"],["free trial","/ˌfriː ˈtraɪəl/","phr.","免費試用","Sign up for a 30-day free trial.","註冊享有三十天免費試用。"],["up-to-date","/ˌʌp tə ˈdeɪt/","adj.","最新的","Keep your antivirus software up-to-date.","請讓防毒軟體保持最新。"],["advanced","/ədˈvænst/","adj.","先進的；進階的","The factory uses advanced robotics.","這間工廠使用先進的機器人技術。"],["high-tech","/ˌhaɪ ˈtek/","adj.","高科技的","The new building has a high-tech security system.","新大樓有高科技的保全系統。"],["security guard","/sɪˈkjʊrəti ɡɑːrd/","phr.","保全、警衛","A security guard is on duty 24 hours a day.","保全人員二十四小時值勤。"],["security camera","/sɪˈkjʊrəti ˌkæmərə/","phr.","監視攝影機","Security cameras cover every entrance.","每個入口都有監視攝影機。"],["security system","/sɪˈkjʊrəti ˌsɪstəm/","phr.","保全系統","The security system is armed at 10 p.m.","保全系統晚上十點設定啟動。"],["access card","/ˈækses kɑːrd/","phr.","門禁卡","Your access card works only on your floor.","你的門禁卡只能用在你那一層。"],["fire alarm","/ˈfaɪər əˌlɑːrm/","phr.","火災警報器","The fire alarm will be tested at noon.","火災警報器將在中午進行測試。"],["fire exit","/ˈfaɪər ˌeɡzɪt/","phr.","逃生出口","Never block the fire exits.","絕對不要擋住逃生出口。"],["smoke detector","/ˈsmoʊk dɪˌtektər/","phr.","煙霧偵測器","Smoke detectors are checked every six months.","煙霧偵測器每六個月檢查一次。"],["adjournment","/əˈdʒɝːnmənt/","n.","休會、散會","The chair called for an adjournment until two o'clock.","主席宣布休會到兩點。"],["next on the agenda","/ˌnekst ɑːn ði əˈdʒendə/","phr.","議程的下一項","Next on the agenda is the hiring plan.","議程的下一項是招聘計畫。"],["shareholders' meeting","/ˈʃerhoʊldərz ˌmiːtɪŋ/","phr.","股東大會","The merger will be voted on at the shareholders' meeting.","合併案將在股東大會上表決。"],["annual general meeting","/ˌænjuəl ˌdʒenərəl ˈmiːtɪŋ/","phr.","年度股東大會","The annual general meeting will be held in June.","年度股東大會將於六月舉行。"],["motion","/ˈmoʊʃən/","n.","（會議）動議、提案","The motion to raise prices was approved.","漲價的動議獲得通過。"],["unanimously","/juˈnænəməsli/","adv.","全體一致地","The board unanimously approved the budget.","董事會一致通過了預算。"],["reach a consensus","/ˌriːtʃ ə kənˈsensəs/","phr.","達成共識","The team failed to reach a consensus on pricing.","團隊在定價上未能達成共識。"],["facilitator","/fəˈsɪləteɪtər/","n.","引導者、會議主持人","The facilitator kept the discussion on topic.","引導者讓討論不偏離主題。"],["panelist","/ˈpænəlɪst/","n.","座談會成員、與談人","Each panelist spoke for ten minutes.","每位與談人各發言十分鐘。"],["elaborate on","/ɪˈlæbəreɪt ɑːn/","phr.","詳細說明","Could you elaborate on your marketing plan?","您可以詳細說明您的行銷計畫嗎？"],["question-and-answer session","/ˌkwestʃən ən ˈænsər ˌseʃən/","phr.","問答時間","A question-and-answer session will follow the talk.","演講後將有問答時間。"],["have the floor","/ˌhæv ðə ˈflɔːr/","phr.","有發言權、輪到發言","Mr. Lee, you have the floor.","李先生，請您發言。"],["address the audience","/əˌdres ði ˈɔːdiəns/","phr.","對聽眾發表演說","The mayor will address the audience after lunch.","市長將在午餐後向聽眾致詞。"],["negotiating table","/nɪˈɡoʊʃieɪtɪŋ ˌteɪbəl/","phr.","談判桌","Both sides returned to the negotiating table.","雙方重回談判桌。"],["bargaining","/ˈbɑːrɡənɪŋ/","n.","談判、討價還價","After some bargaining, we agreed on a lower price.","經過一番討價還價，我們議定了較低的價格。"],["concession","/kənˈseʃən/","n.","讓步","We made several concessions to close the deal.","為了成交我們做了幾項讓步。"],["meet halfway","/ˌmiːt ˌhæfˈweɪ/","phr.","各讓一步、折衷","Let's meet halfway on the shipping costs.","運費我們各讓一步吧。"],["middle ground","/ˌmɪdəl ˈɡraʊnd/","phr.","折衷點、中間立場","We tried to find a middle ground on price.","我們試著在價格上找到折衷點。"],["mutually beneficial","/ˌmjuːtʃuəli ˌbenəˈfɪʃəl/","phr.","互惠互利的","We hope to build a mutually beneficial relationship.","我們希望建立互惠互利的關係。"],["come to an agreement","/ˌkʌm tu ən əˈɡriːmənt/","phr.","達成協議","We came to an agreement on the delivery schedule.","我們就交貨時程達成協議。"],["seal the deal","/ˌsiːl ðə ˈdiːl/","phr.","敲定交易","A free trial helped us seal the deal.","免費試用幫我們敲定了這筆交易。"],["terms and conditions","/ˌtɝːmz ən kənˈdɪʃənz/","phr.","條款與條件","Please read the terms and conditions carefully.","請仔細閱讀條款與條件。"],["draft a contract","/ˌdræft ə ˈkɑːntrækt/","phr.","草擬合約","Our legal team will draft a contract this week.","我們的法務團隊本週會草擬合約。"],["enter into","/ˈentər ˌɪntuː/","phr.","簽訂、開始（協議、談判）","We entered into an agreement with a new supplier.","我們與新供應商簽訂了協議。"],["binding agreement","/ˌbaɪndɪŋ əˈɡriːmənt/","phr.","有約束力的協議","Once signed, this is a binding agreement.","一經簽署，這就是具約束力的協議。"],["legally binding","/ˌliːɡəli ˈbaɪndɪŋ/","phr.","具有法律約束力的","An email can be legally binding in some cases.","在某些情況下，電子郵件也具有法律約束力。"],["invalid","/ɪnˈvælɪd/","adj.","無效的","The contract is invalid without a signature.","沒有簽名的合約是無效的。"],["come into effect","/ˌkʌm ˌɪntu ɪˈfekt/","phr.","開始生效","The new law comes into effect on January 1.","新法將於一月一日生效。"],["effective date","/ɪˈfektɪv ˌdeɪt/","phr.","生效日期","The effective date of the policy is March 1.","本政策的生效日期為三月一日。"],["terminate a contract","/ˌtɝːmɪneɪt ə ˈkɑːntrækt/","phr.","終止合約","We may terminate the contract with 30 days' notice.","我們可在三十天前通知後終止合約。"],["breach of contract","/ˌbriːtʃ əv ˈkɑːntrækt/","phr.","違約","Late delivery may be treated as a breach of contract.","延遲交貨可能被視為違約。"],["abide by","/əˈbaɪd baɪ/","phr.","遵守","All employees must abide by the code of conduct.","全體員工都必須遵守行為準則。"],["compliant","/kəmˈplaɪənt/","adj.","符合規定的","All our products are compliant with EU standards.","我們所有產品都符合歐盟標準。"],["conform to","/kənˈfɔːrm tuː/","phr.","符合、遵照","The design must conform to safety rules.","設計必須符合安全規定。"],["be obliged to","/bi əˈblaɪdʒd tuː/","phr.","有義務、被迫","We are obliged to report the incident.","我們有義務通報這起事件。"],["liable for","/ˈlaɪəbəl fɔːr/","phr.","對…負有（法律）責任","The seller is liable for any damage in transit.","運送途中的任何損壞由賣方負責。"],["lawful","/ˈlɔːfəl/","adj.","合法的","We only collect data for lawful purposes.","我們只為合法目的蒐集資料。"],["unlawful","/ʌnˈlɔːfəl/","adj.","非法的、違法的","The court ruled the dismissal unlawful.","法院判決該解僱違法。"],["lawmaker","/ˈlɔːmeɪkər/","n.","立法者、立法委員","Lawmakers are debating the new tax bill.","立法委員正在辯論新稅法。"],["ethics","/ˈeθɪks/","n.","倫理、道德規範","Business ethics are taught in every training session.","每次訓練都會教授商業倫理。"],["unethical","/ʌnˈeθɪkəl/","adj.","不道德的","Accepting gifts from suppliers is unethical.","收受供應商的禮物是不道德的。"],["transparent","/trænsˈperənt/","adj.","透明的、公開的","We want the hiring process to be transparent.","我們希望招聘流程是透明公開的。"],["investigation","/ɪnˌvestəˈɡeɪʃən/","n.","調查","An internal investigation is under way.","內部調查正在進行中。"],["accuse","/əˈkjuːz/","v.","指控","The firm was accused of copying a design.","該公司被指控抄襲設計。"],["file a lawsuit","/ˌfaɪl ə ˈlɑːsuːt/","phr.","提起訴訟","The client filed a lawsuit over the delay.","客戶因延誤提起訴訟。"],["out of court","/ˌaʊt əv ˈkɔːrt/","phr.","庭外（和解）","The two companies settled out of court.","兩家公司庭外和解了。"],["verdict","/ˈvɝːdɪkt/","n.","判決、裁決","The verdict is expected next week.","判決預計下週出爐。"],["ruling","/ˈruːlɪŋ/","n.","裁決、裁定","The court's ruling favored our company.","法院的裁決對我們公司有利。"],["legal counsel","/ˌliːɡəl ˈkaʊnsəl/","phr.","法律顧問","Please consult legal counsel before signing.","簽約前請諮詢法律顧問。"],["legal department","/ˈliːɡəl dɪˌpɑːrtmənt/","phr.","法務部","Send the draft to the legal department for review.","請把草稿送法務部審閱。"],["take legal action","/ˌteɪk ˌliːɡəl ˈækʃən/","phr.","採取法律行動","We may take legal action if payment is not made.","若未付款，我們可能採取法律行動。"],["entitle","/ɪnˈtaɪtəl/","v.","使有權利、給予資格","This card entitles you to a ten percent discount.","這張卡讓您享有九折優惠。"],["intellectual property","/ˌɪntəˌlektʃuəl ˈprɑːpərti/","phr.","智慧財產","We must protect our intellectual property.","我們必須保護我們的智慧財產。"],["licensing","/ˈlaɪsənsɪŋ/","n.","授權、許可","The licensing fee is paid every year.","授權費每年支付。"],["nondisclosure agreement","/ˌnɑːndɪsˈkloʊʒər əˌɡriːmənt/","phr.","保密協議（NDA）","Both firms signed a nondisclosure agreement.","兩家公司簽署了保密協議。"],["sensitive","/ˈsensətɪv/","adj.","機密的、敏感的","Please do not email sensitive information.","請勿用電子郵件傳送機密資訊。"],["written consent","/ˌrɪtən kənˈsent/","phr.","書面同意","We need your written consent to share this data.","分享這些資料需要您的書面同意。"],["prior consent","/ˌpraɪər kənˈsent/","phr.","事先同意","No changes may be made without prior consent.","未經事先同意不得做任何更改。"],["written notice","/ˌrɪtən ˈnoʊtɪs/","phr.","書面通知","Please give us written notice of cancellation.","取消請以書面通知我們。"],["advance notice","/ədˌvæns ˈnoʊtɪs/","phr.","事先通知","Prices may change without advance notice.","價格可能在未事先通知的情況下變動。"],["govern","/ˈɡʌvərn/","v.","管理、支配；規範","Strict rules govern the use of client data.","客戶資料的使用受到嚴格規範。"],["regulatory approval","/ˌreɡjələtɔːri əˈpruːvəl/","phr.","主管機關核准","The deal still needs regulatory approval.","這筆交易仍需主管機關核准。"],["authorities","/əˈθɔːrətiz/","n.","當局、主管機關","We reported the problem to the authorities.","我們已向主管機關通報此問題。"],["authorized","/ˈɔːθəraɪzd/","adj.","經授權的","Only authorized staff may enter this area.","僅限經授權的人員進入此區。"],["pending approval","/ˌpendɪŋ əˈpruːvəl/","phr.","待核准","The new budget is pending approval.","新預算正待核准。"],["veto","/ˈviːtoʊ/","v./n.","否決（權）","The CEO vetoed the proposal.","執行長否決了這項提案。"],["alter","/ˈɔːltər/","v.","更改、改變","We cannot alter the terms after signing.","簽約後我們無法更改條款。"],["alteration","/ˌɔːltəˈreɪʃən/","n.","變更、修改","Please initial any alterations to the document.","文件上任何更動處請簽名縮寫。"],["lift a ban","/ˌlɪft ə ˈbæn/","phr.","解除禁令","The government lifted the ban on imports.","政府解除了進口禁令。"],["cap","/kæp/","n./v.","上限；設上限","There is a cap on travel expenses.","差旅費有上限。"],["rules and regulations","/ˌruːlz ən ˌreɡjəˈleɪʃənz/","phr.","規章制度","New staff must learn the rules and regulations.","新進員工必須熟悉規章制度。"],["under the terms of","/ˌʌndər ðə ˈtɝːmz əv/","phr.","根據…的條款","Under the terms of the lease, rent is due monthly.","根據租約條款，租金需按月繳納。"],["with respect to","/wɪð rɪˈspekt tuː/","phr.","關於","With respect to pricing, we are flexible.","關於價格，我們有彈性。"],["in terms of","/ɪn ˈtɝːmz əv/","phr.","就…而言","In terms of quality, our product is the best.","就品質而言，我們的產品是最好的。"],["effective immediately","/ɪˌfektɪv ɪˈmiːdiətli/","phr.","立即生效","Effective immediately, all visitors must sign in.","即日起，所有訪客都必須登記。"],["strategic plan","/strəˌtiːdʒɪk ˈplæn/","phr.","策略計畫","The board approved a five-year strategic plan.","董事會通過了一份五年策略計畫。"],["mission statement","/ˈmɪʃən ˌsteɪtmənt/","phr.","企業使命宣言","Our mission statement is posted in the lobby.","我們的使命宣言張貼在大廳。"],["core business","/ˌkɔːr ˈbɪznəs/","phr.","核心業務","We sold the unit to focus on our core business.","我們出售該部門以專注核心業務。"],["competitive advantage","/kəmˌpetətɪv ədˈvæntɪdʒ/","phr.","競爭優勢","Our technology is our main competitive advantage.","技術是我們主要的競爭優勢。"],["take the initiative","/ˌteɪk ðə ɪˈnɪʃətɪv/","phr.","主動","She took the initiative to contact the client.","她主動聯絡了客戶。"],["sustainability","/səˌsteɪnəˈbɪləti/","n.","永續性","Sustainability is part of our long-term strategy.","永續是我們長期策略的一部分。"],["risk management","/ˈrɪsk ˌmænɪdʒmənt/","phr.","風險管理","Good risk management protects the company.","良好的風險管理能保護公司。"],["contingency plan","/kənˈtɪndʒənsi ˌplæn/","phr.","應變計畫","We need a contingency plan in case of delays.","我們需要一套應對延誤的應變計畫。"],["roadmap","/ˈroʊdmæp/","n.","路線圖、規劃藍圖","The product roadmap covers the next two years.","產品路線圖涵蓋未來兩年。"],["decision-making","/dɪˈsɪʒən ˌmeɪkɪŋ/","n.","決策","Employees should be involved in decision-making.","員工應該參與決策。"],["decisive","/dɪˈsaɪsɪv/","adj.","果斷的；決定性的","A good leader must be decisive.","好的領導者必須果斷。"],["resolution","/ˌrezəˈluːʃən/","n.","決議；解決","The board passed a resolution to raise prices.","董事會通過了漲價的決議。"],["judgment","/ˈdʒʌdʒmənt/","n.","判斷力；判決","Use your best judgment when dealing with clients.","與客戶打交道時請做最好的判斷。"],["senior management","/ˌsiːnjər ˈmænɪdʒmənt/","phr.","高階管理層","Senior management will announce the decision.","高階管理層將宣布此決定。"],["top management","/ˌtɑːp ˈmænɪdʒmənt/","phr.","最高管理階層","Top management supports the new strategy.","最高管理階層支持新策略。"],["middle management","/ˌmɪdəl ˈmænɪdʒmənt/","phr.","中階管理層","Middle management was reduced during the restructuring.","重組期間中階管理層被縮減。"],["chairperson","/ˈtʃerpɝːsən/","n.","主席","The chairperson asked for a vote.","主席要求進行表決。"],["chief executive officer","/ˌtʃiːf ɪɡˌzekjətɪv ˈɔːfɪsər/","phr.","執行長（CEO）","She became chief executive officer in 2024.","她於 2024 年成為執行長。"],["co-founder","/ˌkoʊˈfaʊndər/","n.","共同創辦人","He is a co-founder of the software company.","他是這家軟體公司的共同創辦人。"],["empower","/ɪmˈpaʊər/","v.","授權；使有能力","We empower staff to make decisions.","我們授權員工自行決策。"],["inspire","/ɪnˈspaɪər/","v.","激勵、啟發","A good manager inspires the team.","好的主管能激勵團隊。"],["guidance","/ˈɡaɪdəns/","n.","指導、引導","Thank you for your guidance on this project.","謝謝您在這個專案上的指導。"],["coordination","/koʊˌɔːrdəˈneɪʃən/","n.","協調","The event requires coordination between departments.","這場活動需要部門間的協調。"],["collaborative","/kəˈlæbərətɪv/","adj.","合作的、協作的","We have a collaborative work culture.","我們有合作的工作文化。"],["cooperative","/koʊˈɑːpərətɪv/","adj.","合作的、配合的","The supplier has been very cooperative.","這家供應商一直很配合。"],["boost morale","/ˌbuːst məˈræl/","phr.","提振士氣","The bonus helped boost morale.","這筆獎金幫助提振了士氣。"],["answer to","/ˈænsər tuː/","phr.","向…負責、聽命於","The CEO answers to the board of directors.","執行長要向董事會負責。"],["parent company","/ˈperənt ˌkʌmpəni/","phr.","母公司","The parent company is based in Germany.","母公司設在德國。"],["merge with","/ˈmɝːdʒ wɪð/","phr.","與…合併","The bank will merge with a smaller rival.","這家銀行將與一家較小的對手合併。"],["takeover","/ˈteɪkoʊvər/","n.","收購、接管","The takeover was completed in March.","收購案於三月完成。"],["joint venture","/ˌdʒɔɪnt ˈventʃər/","phr.","合資企業","They formed a joint venture in China.","他們在中國成立了合資企業。"],["alliance","/əˈlaɪəns/","n.","聯盟、結盟","The airlines formed an alliance to share routes.","航空公司結盟以共享航線。"],["form a partnership","/ˌfɔːrm ə ˈpɑːrtnərʃɪp/","phr.","建立合作關係","We formed a partnership with a local bank.","我們和一家當地銀行建立合作關係。"],["collaborate with","/kəˈlæbəreɪt wɪð/","phr.","與…合作","We collaborate with designers around the world.","我們與世界各地的設計師合作。"],["cooperate with","/koʊˈɑːpəreɪt wɪð/","phr.","與…配合、合作","Please cooperate with the auditors.","請配合稽核人員。"],["project manager","/ˈprɑːdʒekt ˌmænɪdʒər/","phr.","專案經理","The project manager updated the schedule.","專案經理更新了時程表。"],["project management","/ˈprɑːdʒekt ˌmænɪdʒmənt/","phr.","專案管理","She has a certificate in project management.","她持有專案管理證照。"],["kickoff meeting","/ˈkɪkɔːf ˌmiːtɪŋ/","phr.","啟動會議","The kickoff meeting is set for Monday.","啟動會議訂在星期一。"],["initiate","/ɪˈnɪʃieɪt/","v.","發起、開始","The company initiated a cost-cutting program.","公司啟動了一項節省成本的計畫。"],["proceed with","/proʊˈsiːd wɪð/","phr.","繼續進行","We will proceed with the plan as scheduled.","我們會按計畫繼續進行。"],["status report","/ˈsteɪtəs rɪˌpɔːrt/","phr.","狀態報告、進度報告","Send me a weekly status report.","請每週寄給我一份進度報告。"],["off track","/ˌɔːf ˈtræk/","phr.","偏離計畫","The project went off track after the budget cut.","預算刪減後專案偏離了計畫。"],["extend a deadline","/ɪkˌstend ə ˈdedlaɪn/","phr.","延長截止期限","Can we extend the deadline by one week?","我們可以把截止日延長一週嗎？"],["working group","/ˈwɝːkɪŋ ˌɡruːp/","phr.","工作小組","A working group will study the new rules.","將由工作小組研究新規定。"],["steering committee","/ˈstɪrɪŋ kəˌmɪti/","phr.","指導委員會","The steering committee meets once a month.","指導委員會每月開會一次。"],["execute","/ˈeksɪkjuːt/","v.","執行、實施；簽署（合約）","We need the right people to execute the plan.","我們需要合適的人來執行這個計畫。"],["execution","/ˌeksɪˈkjuːʃən/","n.","執行、實施","A good plan needs good execution.","好的計畫需要好的執行。"],["put into practice","/ˌpʊt ˌɪntu ˈpræktɪs/","phr.","付諸實行","It's time to put the new policy into practice.","是時候將新政策付諸實行了。"],["bring forward","/ˌbrɪŋ ˈfɔːrwərd/","phr.","提前；提出","The meeting has been brought forward to Tuesday.","會議提前到星期二。"],["set back","/ˌset ˈbæk/","phr.","使延誤、阻礙","The storm set back the project by two weeks.","暴風雨使專案延誤了兩週。"],["hold up","/ˌhoʊld ˈʌp/","phr.","延誤、耽擱","The shipment was held up at customs.","這批貨在海關被耽擱了。"],["accelerate","/əkˈseləreɪt/","v.","加速、加快","We need to accelerate the hiring process.","我們需要加快招聘流程。"],["urgency","/ˈɝːdʒənsi/","n.","緊急、急迫","Please treat this matter with urgency.","請緊急處理這件事。"],["pressing","/ˈpresɪŋ/","adj.","緊迫的","We have more pressing issues to discuss.","我們有更緊迫的問題要討論。"],["realistic","/ˌriːəˈlɪstɪk/","adj.","實際的、務實的","Please set a realistic deadline.","請設定一個實際的期限。"],["ambitious","/æmˈbɪʃəs/","adj.","有雄心的、野心大的","The company has ambitious plans for growth.","公司有雄心勃勃的成長計畫。"],["submission","/səbˈmɪʃən/","n.","提交（物）","The deadline for submission is May 15.","提交截止日為五月十五日。"],["request for proposal","/rɪˌkwest fər prəˈpoʊzəl/","phr.","徵求建議書（RFP）","The city issued a request for proposal for the bridge.","市政府針對這座橋發出了徵求建議書。"],["make a pitch","/ˌmeɪk ə ˈpɪtʃ/","phr.","做提案、推銷","We will make a pitch to the client tomorrow.","我們明天要向客戶提案。"],["award a contract","/əˌwɔːrd ə ˈkɑːntrækt/","phr.","授予合約、決標","The city awarded the contract to a local builder.","市政府將合約授予一家本地營造商。"],["secure a deal","/sɪˌkjʊr ə ˈdiːl/","phr.","拿下交易","She secured a deal with a major retailer.","她拿下了與大型零售商的交易。"],["lose a contract","/ˌluːz ə ˈkɑːntrækt/","phr.","失去合約","We lost the contract to a cheaper competitor.","我們輸給了一家較便宜的競爭者而失去合約。"],["renegotiate","/ˌriːnɪˈɡoʊʃieɪt/","v.","重新協商","We want to renegotiate the payment terms.","我們想重新協商付款條件。"],["draft agreement","/ˌdræft əˈɡriːmənt/","phr.","協議草案","Please review the draft agreement by Friday.","請在週五前審閱協議草案。"],["verbal agreement","/ˌvɝːbəl əˈɡriːmənt/","phr.","口頭協議","We only have a verbal agreement so far.","目前我們只有口頭協議。"],["written agreement","/ˌrɪtən əˈɡriːmənt/","phr.","書面協議","Always get a written agreement before starting work.","開工前務必取得書面協議。"],["formally","/ˈfɔːrməli/","adv.","正式地","The deal was formally announced on Monday.","這筆交易於星期一正式宣布。"],["approve of","/əˈpruːv əv/","phr.","贊成、認可","The director does not approve of the new design.","處長不贊成新設計。"],["objection","/əbˈdʒekʃən/","n.","反對、異議","Are there any objections to the plan?","有人反對這個計畫嗎？"],["oppose","/əˈpoʊz/","v.","反對","Many employees oppose the relocation.","許多員工反對搬遷。"],["conflict of interest","/ˌkɑːnflɪkt əv ˈɪntrəst/","phr.","利益衝突","Please report any conflict of interest.","請申報任何利益衝突。"],["resolve a dispute","/rɪˌzɑːlv ə dɪˈspjuːt/","phr.","解決爭議","We hired a mediator to resolve the dispute.","我們請了調解人來解決爭議。"],["mediator","/ˈmiːdieɪtər/","n.","調解人","A neutral mediator helped both sides.","一位中立的調解人協助了雙方。"],["back out of","/ˌbæk ˈaʊt əv/","phr.","退出、食言","The buyer backed out of the deal at the last minute.","買方在最後一刻退出了交易。"],["opt in","/ˌɑːpt ˈɪn/","phr.","選擇加入","Customers must opt in to receive emails.","顧客必須選擇加入才會收到電子郵件。"],["renew a contract","/rɪˌnuː ə ˈkɑːntrækt/","phr.","續約","We decided to renew the contract for two years.","我們決定續約兩年。"],["contract renewal","/ˈkɑːntrækt rɪˌnuːəl/","phr.","合約續簽","Contract renewal talks begin next month.","續約談判下個月開始。"],["short-term contract","/ˌʃɔːrt tɝːm ˈkɑːntrækt/","phr.","短期合約","He works on a short-term contract.","他簽的是短期合約。"],["exclusive rights","/ɪkˌskluːsɪv ˈraɪts/","phr.","獨家權利","The company holds exclusive rights to sell the brand.","這家公司擁有該品牌的獨家銷售權。"],["public statement","/ˌpʌblɪk ˈsteɪtmənt/","phr.","公開聲明","The company issued a public statement about the recall.","公司針對召回發表了公開聲明。"],["call to order","/ˌkɔːl tu ˈɔːrdər/","phr.","宣布（會議）開始","The chair called the meeting to order at nine.","主席九點宣布會議開始。"],["touch on","/ˈtʌtʃ ɑːn/","phr.","簡單提及","The speaker touched on the new regulations.","講者簡單提到了新法規。"],["put forward","/ˌpʊt ˈfɔːrwərd/","phr.","提出（建議、計畫）","She put forward a plan to cut costs.","她提出了一個削減成本的計畫。"],["counterproposal","/ˈkaʊntərprəˌpoʊzəl/","n.","反提案","The union made a counterproposal on wages.","工會在薪資上提出了反提案。"]]});
